<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Ŵakulamula</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Ŵakulamula</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ŵakulamula</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ŵaku</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ŵakulamula</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha ŵakulamula chikutusalila ndaŵi ja Ŵaisilaeli pakumala kuchigungumuchila ni kuchijigala chilambo cha ku Kanaani kuŵa chao. Chipindi chi Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji nkuujilaujila kwaleka Akunnungu, ni Akunnungu nombe ŵaakulupusyaga. Kakajinji, Ŵaisilaeli akatandite kuipopolela inyago ya minungu, nipele Akunnungu akaajimiche ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine aiche kukwalagasya. Pakumala ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine kwalagasya, ŵandu ŵatandite sooni kulila ni kwaujilila Akunnungu ni Akunnungu nombe ŵaliji nkwaŵichila ilongola ŵaŵaŵilanjikwe “Ŵakulamula,” kuti ŵaalongosye ŵandu, ŵaatyosye kwa ŵandu wo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngapagwa mundu jwakumanyilila kusyene kuti nduni jwalembile chitababu cha Ŵakulamula. Ŵandu ŵajinji kwa kugakuya mapochelo gakupisyangana pisyangana, ŵakulupilile kuti jwakulondola che Samweli ni juŵalembile, nambo tukukombola kuŵa ni usyene kuti chalembekwe katema Ŵaisilaeli ali ni mwenye, pakuŵa chitabu chikulosya mwamujinji kuti Ŵaisilaeli nganakola mwenye mu sula ja 17:6; ni sula ja 18:1; ni sula ja 19:1; ni sula ja 21:25. Iŵaga ndema sya Ŵaisilaeli kukopoka ku Misili syaliji pa chaka cha 1400 Akanaŵe kupagwa Kilisto, nnolechesye mu chilongolelo cha chitabu cha Kutyoka kwa kusalichisya nnope, nipele ikukomboleka indu yaipanganyisye ŵakulamula yaliji pasikati ja chaka cha 1300 mpaka 1050 Akanaŵe kupagwa Kilisto, katema paŵasagulikwe che Sauli kuŵa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani sya ngondo jambesi pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ni Ŵakanaani pakumala kuwa che Yoshua. Iyoyo peyo sikusala nkati ndema sya ŵakulamula katema Akunnungu paŵaasagulile ilongola ŵaŵaalongwesya ni kwakulupusya Ŵaisilaeli atyoche mmakono mwa ŵammagongo ŵao, mu sula ja 1 mpaka sula ja 3:6</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani sya ŵakulamula ŵakupisyangana ŵaŵaŵichikwe ni Akunnungu kwakamuchisya Ŵaisilaeli mu sula ja 3:7 mpaka sula ja 16:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani sya utindiganyo wine wautesile Ŵaisilaeli mu sula ja 17 mpaka sula ja 21.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Ngosyo sya Yuda ni Simeoni sikunkamula che Adonibeseki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Pakumala kuwa che Yoshua Ŵaisilaeli ŵaausisye Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ana lukosyo chi pasikati jetu luchilulongolele kwaula kukumenyana ni ŵandu ŵa ku Kanaani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Lukosyo lwa Yuda tiluchitanda kwaula, naatesile ŵaapunde Ŵakanaani ni kuchijigala chilambo chao.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Nipele ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵaasalile achalongo achinjawo ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Simeoni, “Nkamulangane ni uweji patukwaula kukumenyana ngondo ni Ŵakaanani ni kuchijigala chilambo cho. Uweji nombe tutukamulangane ni ŵanyamwe kukumenyana ngondo ni kuchijigala chilambo chichimpegwe.” Kwapele lukosyo lwa Simeoni lwakundile kukamulangana nao. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵapite kukwagungumuchila Ŵakanaani ni Ŵapelesi, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatendekasisye ŵapunde ŵanyawo. Ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵaauleje achalume elufu kumi ku musi wa ku Beseki ko. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Kweleko ŵansimene mwenye che Adonibeseki, ni kumenyana najo, ni ŵaapundile Ŵakanaani ni Ŵapelesi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Che Adonibeseki ŵautwiche, nambo ŵanyawo ŵankuilisye ni ŵankamwile, ŵankatile ikongo yammakono ni makongolo gakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Che Adonibeseki ŵatite, “Mamwenye sabini unaakatile ikongo yammakono ni makongolo gao ŵalokotaga makoombo kuusi mesa jangu. Sambano Akunnungu andesile ilaila inaatendele ŵanyawo.” Nipele Ŵayuda ŵanjigele mwenye che Adoni Beseki kwaulanajo ku Yelusalemu, ni ŵawilile kweleko.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda akwapunda ŵandu ŵa ku Yelusalemu ni ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵaagungumuchile ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Yelusalemu ni kuujigala musi wo. Ŵaauleje ŵaŵatamaga mwelemo ni mapanga ni kuutinisya musi wo. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Pakumala yeleyo, ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵatulwiche kukumenyana ni Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatamaga ku chilambo cha ikwesya, ni ŵane ŵaŵatamaga ku chilambo changalimesi chachili kulujenda ni ŵane ŵaŵatamaga ku chilambo chachili mwiŵata chiŵandika ni kubwani. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Pakumala yeleyo ŵapite kwagungumuchile Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatamaga mu musi wa ku Hebuloni, kalakala ko musi wu waŵilanjikwe Kiliati Alaba. Ni kweleko ŵaapundile ŵa uŵelesi wa Sheshai ni Ahimani ni Talimai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Otinieli akuupunda musi wa Debili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:13-19">Yoshua 15:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Kutyochela kweleko ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵapite kukumenyana ni ŵandu ŵa ku Debili, kalakala ko musi wo waŵilanjikwe Kiliati Sefeli. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Che Kalebu ŵatangesye kuti, “Mundu jwalijose jutaupute musi wa Kiliati Sefeli ni kuusumula chinjinlombekasya mwali jwangu liina lyakwe che Akisa.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Nipele, che Otinieli, nchanda ju che Kenasi, mpwakwe che Kalebu, ŵaapundile ŵandu ŵa musi wo, ni che Kalebu ŵanlombekasisye che Akisa mwali jwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Che Akisa paŵaiche ku che Otinieli, che Akisa, ŵaachisisye ŵankwakwe kuti ŵaŵende ngunda che Kalebu, atatigwe. Che Akisa ŵatulwiche pa mbunda jakwe, nipele che Kalebu ŵammusisye, “Nkusaka nampe ichichi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Che Akisa ŵajanjile, “Mundendele lusagu. Pakuŵa muumbele lisi lyakulujenda lyalili lyejumu, muumbe ni iliŵa ya mesi.” Che Kalebu ŵampele iliŵa ya mesi ya kwichela ni kwiŵanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukosyo lwa Yuda ni lukosyo lwa Benjamini akupunda pangondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Wandu ŵa uŵelesi wa che Keni juŵaliji akwegwao ŵalume che Musa, ŵalongene ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda kutyochela ku musi wa itela ya mitende, liina line musi wa ku Yeliko mpaka ku lipululu lya Yuda, chiŵandika ni musi wa Aladi. Ni ŵatemi pamo ni Ŵayuda kweleko. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵakamulangene ni ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Simeoni, ŵaapundile pa ngondo Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatemi ku Sefati. Ŵaujonasile musi wo tikitiki, ŵaupele musi wo liina liine ni ŵauŵilasile Holima. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Iyoyo peyo, ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵausumwile kwa machili musi wa Gasa ni mipika jakwe ni musi wa Ashikeloni ni mipika jakwe ni musi wa Ekiloni ni mipika jakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaakamuchisye ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda, nombe ŵanyawo ŵaatopwele ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mu chilambo cha matumbi ni kuchijigala chilambo cho, nambo nganakombolanga kwatopola ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mu iŵata pakuŵa ŵanyawo itetele yao ya ngondo yaliji ya isyano. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Musi wa Hebuloni ŵampele che Kalebu, mpela che Musa iŵatite pakulajisya, nombejo wajitopwele mitundu jitatu ja che Anaki jijatamaga mwelemo. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini nganiŵaatopola Ŵayebusi ŵaŵatamaga mu Yelusalemu, nipele Ŵayebusi ali nkutama kweleko ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukosyo lwa Efulaimu ni Manase akwapunda ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Nipele ŵangondo ŵa ngosyo sya Yusufu, yaani Efulaimu ni Manase nombewo ŵakwesile kukuugungumuchila musi wa ku Beseli, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaakamuchisye. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Akanaŵe kwaula, ŵaalajisye ŵandu kuuchilichisya musi wa ku Beseli. Musi wo kalakala ko waŵilanjikwe Lusu. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Ŵakuuchilichisya ŵala ŵammweni mundu ali nkutyoka mu musi mo, ni ŵansalile, “Ntulosye litala lyakwinjilila mu musi mu ni uwe ngatummulaga.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Nombejo ŵalosisye, ni ŵanyawo ŵajinjile ni kwaulaga ŵandu wose mwelemo kwa mapanga, akaŵe nganammulaga mundu jula ni ŵamu nyuumba jakwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Nipele, mundu jula ŵasamile ku chilambo cha Ŵahiti, ŵataŵile nsinda kweleko ni kuuŵilanga lina lyakwe Lusu, ni lyele lili liina lyakwe mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandu ŵanganatopolwa ni Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase nginiŵaatopola ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga musi wa Beti Sheani ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa Taanaki ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa Doli ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa Ibuleamu ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa Megido ni misinda jakwe. Ŵakanaani ŵajendelechele kutama mu chilambo cho. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Namose Ŵaisilaeli paŵapatile machili nnope nginiŵaatopola Ŵakanaani, nambo ŵaakanganichisyaga ŵaapanganyichisye masengo gakulimba.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Iyoyo peyo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu nginiŵaatopola Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatamaga ku Geseli, Ŵakanaani ŵajendelechele kutama mu Geseli pamo ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Sabuloni nombe nawo nginiŵaatopola Ŵakanaani ŵaŵatamaga ku Kitiloni ni ku Nahaloli, ŵajendelechele kutama nawo mpela achikapolo.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Asheli nombe nginiŵaatopola ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga misi ja ku Ako ni ku Sidoni ni ku Alabu ni ku Akisibu ni ku Heliba ni ku Afeka ni ku Lehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Asheli ŵatemi pamo ni Ŵakanaani, achinsyene musi wo pakuŵa nginiŵaatopola.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Nafutali nombe nginiŵaatopola achinsyene misi ja Beti Shemeshi ni Beti Anati, nambo ŵatemi pamo nawo. Namose yeleyo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Nafutali ŵaakanganichisyaga achinsyene misi jo ŵaapanganyichisye masengo gakulimba.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Ŵaamoli ŵaakanganyichisye ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani atame ku matumbi, pakuŵa nganiŵakunda aiche kutuluchila kwiŵata. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Ŵaamoli ŵajendelechele kutama misi jijili ku litumbi lya Helesi ni Aiyaloni ni Shaalibimu. Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yusufu, yaani Efulaimu ni Manase paŵapundile kukola machili, ŵaatawele Ŵaamoli ni kwakanganichisya ŵaapanganyichisye masengo gakulimba. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Mpika wa Ŵaamoli waliji kutandilila pamalo pakupita papakuŵilanjikwa Akilabimu, wajendelechele chakumpoto mpaka musi wa ku Sela ni kwendelechela chakwiŵanda.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ku Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakwesile kutyochela ku Giligali kwaula ku Bokimu ni ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli, “Nankwesisye kutyochela ku Misili ni kunjinjisya mu chilambo chinaasalile achinangolo ŵenu kuti tinaape. Une natite, ‘Ngisingasa kose lilangano lyangu ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Ni ŵanyamwe nanlamulile kuti nkataŵa kose lilangano ni ŵandu ŵakutama mu chilambo chi, nambo ngumulanje ilisa yao.’ Nambo ŵanyamwe nganintenda inansalile yo. Kwachichi ntesile yeleyi? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Kwayele ngunsalila, une ngisinaatopola ŵandu ŵa atyoche pasikati jenu, nambo chaachinsausya, ni ŵanyamwe tinchitanjila kujipopelela minungu jao.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaŵechete yeleyo, Ŵaisilaeli wosepe ŵatandite kulila kwakunyanyisya. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Kwayele ŵapaŵilasile peuto pala liina lyakwe Bokimu, malumbo gakwe kulila. Pelepo ŵapeleche mbopesi syakutinisya kwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Che Yoshua paŵaalanjile Ŵaisilaeli, kila mundu ŵajawile pamalo pakwe paŵapegwile paŵe pakwe. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaatumichile Ambuje Akunnungu moŵa gose che Yoshua paŵaliji ŵajumi, ni kanyuma ka chiwa chakwe, ŵajendelechele kutenda iyoyo moŵa gose paŵaliji ŵajumi achachekulu ŵaŵaiweni indu yekulungwa iŵaitesile Ambuje Akunnungu kwa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Che Yoshua mwanache ju che Nuni, ni jwakutumichila jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵawile ali ni yaka mia moja na kumi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Ŵandu ŵansichile ku chilambo chakwe chiŵapegwile kuti chiŵe chakwe, kwele ku Timinasi Helesi, ku chilambo cha matumbi cha ku Efulaimu, chakumpoto kwa litumbi lya Gaashi. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Aula uŵelesi wose uwaliji pakatema ka che Yoshua wawile, ni wakuiye uŵelesi wine wati nganiwamanyilila Ambuje Akunnungu namose indu iŵaatendele Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuleka kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile yaigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kutanda kuitumichila inyango ya minungu baali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Ŵalesile kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa achinangolo ŵao, juŵaakopwesye mu chilambo cha ku Misili. Ŵanyawo ŵajikuiye minungu jine, minungu jiŵajipopelele ŵandu ŵaŵasyungulile. Ŵajijinamile minungu jo ni kwatumbilisya Ambuje Akunnungu kwannope. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Ŵanyawo ŵalesile kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaitumichile inyago ya minungu Baali ni inyago ya nnungu jwankongwe jwakuŵilanjika Ashitaloti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Kwapele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵalesile ŵachiswamba ŵaasumule ipanje yao. Ŵaalesile ŵammagongo ŵao ŵaŵasyungwile mosemose ŵaapunde namose Ŵaisilaeli nganakombola kulichenjela kwa ŵammagongo ŵao. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kwakulikose kuŵajawile kungondo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalesile ŵammagongo ŵaapunde Ŵaisilaeli mpela iŵaajamwiche ni iŵaalumbilile. Ŵaisilaeli ŵalasile kwannope.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapele Ŵaisilaeli ilongola ŵaŵaŵilanjikwe ŵakulamula, ŵaŵaakulupwisye ni aŵala ŵachiswamba ŵaŵaasumwile ipanje yao. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Nambo Ŵaisilaeli nganiŵapilikanila ilongola ŵao wo, ŵatesile mpela ŵachigwagwa kwa kujikuya minungu jine ni kujipopelela. Ŵalesile kwachitema matala ga achinangolo ŵao ŵaŵagapilikanichisye makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, yaani litala lya kugakuya makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Katema Ambuje Akunnungu paŵapele Ŵaisilaeli chilongola, ŵankamuchisye chilongola jo ni kwakulupusya ŵandu ni ŵammagongo ŵao katema kose chilongola jo paakuŵa jwanjumi. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatendele chanasa paŵapilikene kuwuwula kwawo kwaligongo lya kuonelwa ni kulagaswa kwao. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Nambo iŵaga chilongola jula awile, ŵaujilaga mmatala gao gakalakala ni kutenda indu yakusakala nnope kupunda achachekulu ŵao. Ŵajikuiye minungu jine ni kujitumichila ni kujipopelela. Ŵakanile kuleka ugongomalo wao ni makani gao. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile kwannope Ŵaisilaeli ni kuti, “Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵa akaasile lilangano lyangu linataŵile ni achachekulu ŵao, ni kukana kumbilikanila, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />ni une wakwe ngisinaatopola ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine ŵaŵalesile che Yoshua katema paŵawile. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Tinjatenda ŵele ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine wo ŵaalinje Ŵaisilaeli kuti nole iŵaga tachiuja ni kulikuya litala lyangu mpela achachekulu ŵao pane ngwamba.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Kwapele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalesile ŵandu ŵa ngosyo syo, nganiŵatopola kwachitema namose nganantenda che Yoshua ŵapunde ŵandu wo.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine ŵaŵasigalile mu chilambo cha ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Kwapele ŵeleŵa ali ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine ŵati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalesile kuti ŵaalinje Ŵaisilaeli ŵakanajimanyilila ngondo jilijose ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatesile yeleyo kuti achijiganye chipago chilichose cha Ŵaisilaeli kuputana ngondo, nnopennope ŵele ŵanganaputaneje ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Ŵaalesile achakulu nsano ŵa Ŵafilisiti, ni Ŵakanaani wosepe, ni Ŵasidoni ni Ŵahivi ŵaŵatamaga mmatumbi ga Lebanoni, kutandila litumbi lya Baali Helimoni mpaka ku Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Ŵaalesile ŵandu ŵa kuti ŵaalinje Ŵaisilaeli pakuti iyoneche iŵaga chagajitichisye makanyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu gaŵapele che Musa ŵaape achachekulu ŵao. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatemi pamo ni Ŵakanaani ni Ŵahiti ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵapelesi ni Ŵahivi ni Ŵayebusi. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵalombele achiŵali ŵa ngosyo syo, nombe ŵandu ŵa ngosyo syo ŵalombele achiŵali ŵa Ŵaisilaeli, ni kujipopelela minungu ja ŵandu wo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Otinieli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile yachigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaaliŵalile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵao ni kutanda kuipopelela inyago ya minungu Baali ni inyago ya minungu Ashela. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Kwayele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile Ŵaisilaeli, nipele ŵakundile che Kushani Lishataimu, mwenye jwa ku Mesopotamia ŵaapunde, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵantumichile che Kushani Lishataimu kwa yaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Nambo, Ŵaisilaeli paŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasagulile mundu jwakwakulupusya. Akunnungu ŵaasagulile che Otinieli mwanache ju che Kenasi, mpwakwe che Kalebu. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannyichile che Otinieli, nipele ŵaliji chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli. Che Otinieli ŵapite ku ngondo, nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampundisye pakumpunda che Kushani Lishataimu mwenye jwa ku Mesopotamia. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Pelepo mu chilambo mwaliji mwana chitendewele kwa yaka alobaini mpaka che Otinieli mwanagwe che Kenasi paŵawile.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Nipele, Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile sooni ya chigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Kwaligongo li, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele machili che Egiloni mwenye jwa ku Moabu ŵaapunde Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Mwenye che Egiloni ŵalumbikene ni Ŵaamoni ni Ŵaamaleki, nipele ŵapite kukuputana ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaapundile Ŵaisilaeli ni kwasumula musi wa ku Yeliko liina line waŵilanjikwe musi wa Itela ya mitende. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Mwenye che Egiloni jwa ku Moabu ŵaatawele Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka kumi na nane.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Nambo Ŵaisilaeli paŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasaguliele mundu jwakwakulupusya, juŵaŵilanjikwe che Ehudi, mundu jwakupanganya masengo kwa nkono wakunchiji juŵaliji mwanagwe che Gela, kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini. Ŵaisilaeli wantumile che Ehudi ajausye mituuka jawo ku che Egiloni mwenye jwa ku Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Nipele che Ehudi ŵaliji akolosisye lipanga lyakutema kosekose, uleu wakwe futi jimo ni nusu. Ŵalitaŵilile munchiunu, upaande wa kunlyo kwakwe mu yakuwala yakwe. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Nipele ŵampelechele mituuka jila che Egiloni mwenye jwa ku Moabu. Nombe che Egileno ŵaliji mundu jwakwimbala nnope. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Che Ehudi piŵapele mituuka jo, ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵaŵajigele mituuka jo kuti ajaulanje. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Nsyene jo ŵalongene nao mpaka pa chinyago cha maganga gakusepa, chiŵandika ku Giligali, nipele ŵausile sooni kwa mwenye che Egiloni ni kuti, “Alakwe mwenye, une ngwete utenga wenu, ngusaka nansalile kwachisyepela.” Kwapele mwenye ŵaasalile ŵamasengo ŵakwe, “Ntyokangane, ntuleche ŵaŵili.” <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Mwenye ŵatemi jika mu chuumba chakwe cha penani chachikuinjisya mbepo, che Ehudi ŵanjaulile ni kunsalila, “Uneji ngwete utenga wenu kutyochela kwa Akunnungu.” Nipele mwenye ŵajimwiche pachitengu pala ni kwima. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Papopo che Ehudi ŵasolomwele lipanga lyakwe lilyaliji chakunlyo kwakwe ni nkono wakwe wakunchiji ni kulutwinyichisya mu lutumbo lwa che Egiloni. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Lipanga lyose lyajinjile nkati ni chikumbu chakwe, ni lipanga lyo lyakopochele kungongo. Mauta gauniche lipanga lyo ligongo che Ehudi nganalisolomola. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Pelepo che Ehudi ŵakopweche paasa, ŵapujiche minango ja chuumba cho ni kwaugalila.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Paŵatyosile, ŵakutumichila ŵa mwenye ŵaiche ni kujisimana minango ja chuumba jeugale ni ŵaganisisye kuti, “Panepa apite kukusyetelela mu chuumba mo.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Ŵanyawo ŵalindilile mpaka ŵajinjilwe ni lipamba, paŵaiweni ngakuugula pe ŵajigele chiugulilo ni kuugula. Paŵajinjilenje mwelemo ŵammweni mwenye jwao ali agonile paasi nombejo awile.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Paŵaliji nkulindilila pala che Ehudi ŵatisile, ŵapitile pa chinyago cha maganga gakusepa pala ni kuutuchila ku Seila. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Paŵaiche ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu, ŵagombile ngula ntwe kwaŵilanga ŵandu ajaule ku ngondo, nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatulwiche pampepe ni jwelejo, jwelejo ali nkwalongolela. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Nombejo ŵaasalile, “Munguye, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ampundisye ŵanyamwe kwa ŵammagongo ŵenu Ŵamoabu.” Kwayele wankuiye che Ehudi ni kwasumula Ŵamoabu malo gakombochela kwele ku Yolodani, ni ngananneka mundu jwalijose ajomboche pamalo po. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Lyele lyuwa lyo ŵauleje ŵangondo Ŵamoabu elufu kumi, ŵakwete machili nnope ni ŵaakukombola kuputana ngondo, pangali mundu jwalijose juŵakulupwiche. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Lyele lyuŵa lyo Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapundile Ŵamoabu, nipele chapali chitendewele mu chilambo mo kwa yaka semanini.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Shamugali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Paŵawile che Ehudi, che Shamugali mwanache ju che Anati ŵaliji chilongola. Ŵaauleje Ŵafilisiti mia sita kwa lubokola lwaluli ni lusonga lwa chisyano, lwakulongochesya ng'ombe. Ni jweleju nombe ŵaakulupwisye Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Debola ni che Balaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Che Ehudi paŵawile, Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile sooni yachigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatesile ŵangondo ŵa che Yabini mwenye jwa ku Kanaani juŵalongosyaga musi wa ku Hasoli ŵaapunde Ŵaisilaeli. Che Sisela ŵaliji jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵakwe, nombejo ŵatamaga ku Halosheti, chilambo cha ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Mwenye che Yabini ŵakwete itetele mia tisa yangondo. Kwa yaka ishilini ŵaaliŵatile kwannope Ŵaisilaeli. Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ŵalisile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ŵaakamuchisye.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Kele katema ko kwaliji ni jwankongwe liina lyakwe che Debola juŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Lapidoti. Che Debola ŵaliji jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu, ni sooni jwaliji jwakulamula jwa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Che Debola yanonyelaga kutama paasi pa chitela cha ntende chichaliji pasikati ja ku Lama ni ku Beseli mu chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu. Ŵaisilaeli ŵannyichililaga pelepo kuti ŵaalamulile magambo gao. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Lyuŵa limo che Debola ŵannajisye mundu akammilanje che Balaki mwanache ju che Abinoamu juŵatamaga musi wa ku Kadeshi, chilambo cha ku Nafutali. Nombejo paŵaiche ŵansalile kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli akunnajisya kuti, ‘Mwasagule ŵangondo elufu kumi kutyochela mu ngosyo sya Nafutali ni Sabuloni ni kwalongosya kwaula ku chitumbi cha Taboli. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Ni une chinjachisya che Sisela jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵa che Yabini aiche ni itetele yakwe ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ku lusulo lwa Kishoni kuti amenyane ni ŵanyamwe, ni une tinjintenda mumpunde.’ ” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Nipele che Balaki ŵansalile che Debola, “Tinjijaula iŵaga nkwaula ni une, nambo iŵaga nganjaula ni une, none jwakwe nganyaula.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Che Debola ŵansalile, “Kusyene tinjijaula ni mmwejo, nambo kweleko mmwejo ngankola luchimbichimbi lulilose pa kwele kupunda ko, ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu tachintenda che Sisela aputikwe ni jwankongwe.” Kwayele che Debola nombe ŵajawile pamo ni che Balaki ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Ku Kadeshi ko, che Balaki ŵaŵilasile ŵangondo kutyochela mu ngosyo sya Sabuloni ni Nafutali, ni ŵakwesile ŵandu elufu kumi ni kwakuya. Che Debola nombejo ŵajawile pamo ni che Balaki.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Pamoŵa go, che Hebeli jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵakeni ŵaliji asamile kutyoka kwa Ŵakeni achinjakwe, uŵelesi u che Hobabu, mkwegwakwe che Musa. Ŵataŵile lisakasa lyakwe chiŵandika ni achila chitela chachikulungwa chachikuwilanjikwa mwaloni chachili ku Saananimu, chiŵandi ni ku Kadeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Che Sisela paŵapilikene kuti che Balaki mwanache ju che Abinoamu akwesile kwitumbi lya Taboli, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />che Sisela ŵaŵilasisye itetele yakwe ya isyano yose mia tisa ni ŵangondo wose ŵaŵaliji pamo najo, ŵatyosile ku Halosheti Hagoimu ni kwaula nawo mpaka ku lusulo lwa Kishoni. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Che Debola ŵansalile che Balaki “Njaule! Ambuje Akunnungu akunkamuchisya. Nombewo chantende mumpute che Sisela.” Nipele che Balaki ŵatulwiche ku litumbi lya Taboli achalongosyaga ŵangondo ŵakwe elufu kumi. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Che Balaki paŵaagungumuchile ni upanga wakwe, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaampwilinganyisye che Sisela ni itetele yakwe ni ŵangondo ŵakwe wose. Che Sisela ŵatulwiche mu chitetele ni kuutuka wapasi. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Nambo che Balaki ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ŵaatopwele ŵangondo ŵa che Sisela ni itetele yakwe mpaka ku Halosheti, chilambo cha ŵandu ŵangaŵa Ŵaisilaeli ni kwaulaga ŵangondo wose kwa lipanga. Nganasigala namose mundu jumo jwanjumi.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Nambo che Sisela ŵautuchile ku lisakasa li che Yaeli juŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Hebeli jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵakeni, pakuŵa kwaliji ni chitendewele pasikati ji che Yabini mwenye jwa ku Hasoli ni ŵamu nyuumba ji che Hebeli jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵakeni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Che Yaeli ŵakopweche kwachingamila che Sisela, ni ŵansalile, “Alakwe achimwene, njinjile mu lisakasa lyangu, njinjile nkajogopa.” Nipele che Sisela wajinjile mu lisakasa li che Yaeli, nombejo ŵambunichile ni libulangeti. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Che Sisela ŵatite, “Choonde mumbe mesi ng'we, jingwete njota.” Jwankongwe jo ŵaugwile nsaku wa lipende uwaliji ni mawele, ŵampele kung'wa, ni ŵammbunichile sooni. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Nombe che Sisela ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Njime pannango wa lisakasa, mundu jwalijose aikaga ni kummusya, ‘Ana kwana mundu jwine mwelemu?’, njileje ‘Nganapagwa.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Che Sisela ŵapesile nnope, nipele ŵagonile mwachitema. Ali mulugono, che Yaeli ŵankwakwe che Hebeli ŵajigele chigingi cha mu lisakasa ni nkomelo, ŵanjaulile kwakunyakatulila ni ŵankomelele chigingi chila pausyo wakwe, nombecho chapowele ntwe wakwe ni kwinjila paasi. Che Sisela ŵawile papopo. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Che Balaki paŵankuyaga che Sisela, che Yaeli ŵakopweche kukuwonegana nao ni ŵansalile, “Njise akuno ni une tinannosye mundu junkunsosa jo.” Che Balaki ŵajinjile mu lisakasa li che Yaeli ni kwasimana che Sisela ali paasi, awile, ni chigingi cha lisakasa chili pa usyo wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Nipele, lyuŵa lila Akunnungu ŵaakamuchisye Ŵaisilaeli kumpunda che Yabini mwenye jwa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Ŵangondo ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵajendelechele kukola machili nnope, ni ŵangondo ŵa che Yabini ŵajendelechele kupwa machili. Mbesi jakwe Ŵaisilaeli ŵaajonasile che Yabini ni ŵangondo ŵao tikitiki.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Lujimbo lu che Debola ni che Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Nipele pa lyele lyuŵa lyo che Debola ni che Balaki mwanache ju che Abinoamu ŵajimbile lujimbo lu,<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />Ilongola ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">ŵandu ŵaakuiye kwakusaka kwawo achinsyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:2">mwalape Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Mpilikane ŵanyamwe mamwenye, mpilikanile ŵanyamwe ilongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Tinaajimbile Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:3">Tinaajimbile lujimbo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, pamwatyosile ku matumbi ga Seili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">Pamwatulwiche ku chitumbi cha Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">chilambo chatinganyiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">kwinani kwakuswile meesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">kusyene, maunde gaanyele ula.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Matumbi gatinganyiche paujo penu Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">kusyene, namose litumbi lya Sinai lyatinganyiche paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Pa moŵa ga che Shamugali mwana ju che Anasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">pa moŵa ga che Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ŵamalonda ŵaŵajausyanga malonda nganaoneka mmatala gamakulungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">ŵapaulendo ŵapitaga mu tutala twamwana.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Ŵakulima ŵalesile kulima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">Ŵakulima ŵamasile ku chilambo cha ku Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">mpaka panaiche une che Debola chilongola jwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">uneji jundi mpela achikulu kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵannesile Akunnungu ni kujipopelela minungu jine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">jakopochele ngondo mu chilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">nganapagwa namose mundu juŵakamwile mpamba namose chakulisiŵila pantima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">pasikati ja ŵangondo elufu alobaini mu Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Ngwachimbichisya ilongola ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">pamo ni ŵandu ŵalityosisye kwakusaka kwao achinsyene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Mwalape Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Ŵanyamwe unkukwela mbunda ŵaswela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mwanya unkutamila indu yatamila ya ndalama jekulungwa, yaikuŵichikwa pachanya pakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">ni ŵanyamwe unkwenda mwitala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">Mwasalile ŵandu ngani ji.<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Mpilikane! malama ga mipingo ja ŵandu ŵakwimba, ŵasyungwile isima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Ŵele ŵakwimba kupunda kwa Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">kupunda kwa ŵandu ŵakwe mu chilambo cha ku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Nipele ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatulwiche pa milango ja musi.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Njimuche che Debola, njimuche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Njimuche, njimuche ntandeje kwimba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Njimeje che Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">njigale ŵandu ŵenu umwakamwile ku ngondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Alakwe mwanache ju che Abinoamu. <verse eid="JDG 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Pelepo ŵangondo ŵaŵasigalile ŵausile kwa ilongola ŵao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaiche kukwangu kukuputana ngondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">ni ŵammagongo ŵetu ŵakwete machili.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ŵangondo ŵaiche kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu, ŵatuluchile kwiŵanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">ŵakuiye achalongo achinjawo ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Kutyochela mu ntundu wa Makili ŵatulwiche achakulungwa ŵa ŵandu ŵangondo kukuputana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni ŵaiche ilongola achakulu ku ngondo ali ajigele nkongojo wa ulamusi.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Achakulu ŵa lukosyo lwa Isakali ŵaiche pamo ni che Debola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">kusyene, ŵandu ŵa Isakali ŵaiche pamo ni che Balaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ŵankuiye achiutukaga mpaka kwiŵanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Nambo mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Lobeni jagaŵanyiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">ŵalepele kutyosya maamuzi kuti ajaule pane akajaula.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Kwachichi mwasigele ni ngondolo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Uli mwaliji nkupilikanila ŵakuchinga ali nkugomba lwisi syakuŵilanga ngondolo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Kusyene mitundu ja lukosyo lwa Lobeni jagaŵanyiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">ŵalepele kutyosya maamuzi kuti ajaule pane akajaula.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Ŵagileadi ŵatemi peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ligongo chichi ŵasigalile ni meli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Asheli nombewo ŵatemi mmajumba mwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">chiŵandi ni bahali.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Sabuloni nganajogopa kuwa ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">iyoyo peyo ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Nafutali nganajogopa ku ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">paŵajawile kwagungumuchila ŵammagongo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Mamwenye ŵaiche kukumenyana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">mamwenye ŵa ku Kanaani ŵaputene ngondo kwele ku Taanaki ko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">chiŵandi ni iliŵa ya meesi ya Megido,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">nambo nganatusumula madini ga feza namose chindu chilichose.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Ndondwa syaputile ngondo kwele kumaunde ko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">pasyaliji nkwenda mmatala gakwe kumaunde ko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">syaputene ni che Sisela. <verse eid="JDG 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Chikumba mesi cha lusulo lwa Kishoni chaakwekwelemye ŵanyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">kusyene chikumba mesi chekulungwa cha lusulo lwa Kishoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Alakwe mbumu jangu njaule mmbujo kwamachili.<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Falasi sya che Sisela syapite kwakwanguya sili nkukochopola kochopola ni sajo syao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">syapitile kwakwanguya ni isindo ya sajo syao yapikaniche.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, “Alweseche ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Melosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">alweseche ŵandu ŵakutama mwelemo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">Pakuŵa ŵakanile kukamuchisya ngondo ja Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">ŵakanile kuputana ngondo ni ŵammagongo, ŵakwete machili.”<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Akole upile che Yaeli, ŵankwakwe che Hebeli jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵakeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">kwapunda achakongwe wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">kusyene akwete upile kwapunda achakongwe wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">ŵakutama mmasakasa.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Che Sisela ŵaŵendile mesi nombewo ŵapele maŵele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">Ŵaapele maŵele gamachesuche mu chombo cha luchimbichimbi.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Ku nkono wakwe wakunchiji ŵakamulile chigingi cha lisakasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ku nkono wakwe wakunlyo ŵakamulile nkomelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ŵankomele che Sisela ni kupowola pausyo jakwe, kasanya ntwe wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">ŵankasenye ntwe wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Che Sisela ŵalijinamile ni ŵagwile pa makongolo ga che Yaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">ni ŵagonile lugono lwakutopela pamakongolo pa che Yaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Palapala paŵalijinamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">ŵagwile paasi ni ŵawile.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Achikulugwe che Sisela ŵalingulile pedilisha lyakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">ŵalindililaga kuti ŵaone achiujaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">ŵatite, “Kwachichi chitetele chakwe chikukaŵa kwika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Kwachichi misindo ja itetele yakwe ikukaaŵa kupikanika?”<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Achakongwe ŵaali ni lunda ŵaŵantumichila ŵanjanjile, nombejo ŵalitulesye ntima ni majanjo go,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">ŵajendelechele kulisalila,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />“Panepa akusosa ni kugaŵana indu yasumwile kungondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">jwankongwe jumo pane ŵaŵili kwa kila jwangondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">nguo jakusalala kwaligongo li che Sisela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">Nguo syakuluka sya langi syakupisyangana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">ni miinjilo jiŵili jakusalala, jeetotele yakusalalichisya mu lukosi, kwaligongo lyangu.<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵammangongo ŵenu wose ajasicheje!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Nambo achambusanga ŵenu ang'alime mpela lyuŵa palikukopoka ni lilanguka lyekulungwa!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31">Nipele chapali chitendewele pachilambo kwa yaka alobaini.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵatesile sooni indu yachigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu wo ŵaatesile ŵandu ŵa ku Midiani ŵaatawale kwa yaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Ŵamidiani ŵaliji ŵamachili kwapunda Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaalagasisye Ŵaisilaeli mpaka ŵautuchile mmatumbi ni kulijuŵa mu mbugu ni mmasimbo. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Kila chaka, Ŵaisilaeli paŵapandaga mbeju jilijose, Ŵamidiani, ni Ŵaamaleki ni ŵandu ŵane ŵa kwele kungopochelo lyuwa ko ŵaikaga ni kwagungumuchila. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Ŵaŵisile igono mu chilambo mo, ŵatandite kuijonanga yakulya ya mmigunda mpaka mu mpika waukwaula ku Gasa, ŵaasumwile ngondolo syao ni ng'ombe ni mbunda, nganiŵaalechela chindu chachilichose Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Ŵammangongo ŵao ŵaikaga ni ilango yao ni masakasa gao. Ŵaliji ŵajinji nti sombe, ni nginikomboleka kwaŵalanga ligongo ŵaliji ŵajinji nnope, nombe ŵajinjile mu chilambo cho kuti achijonanje. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Ŵamidiani ŵaauŵesye kwannope Ŵaisilaeli mpaka kumalilwa kila chindu mwakwichila kwalilila Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaakamuchisye.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatyochesye malagasyo gaŵagapatile kutyochela kwa Ŵamidiani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajauchisye jwakulondola, nombejo ŵaasalile “Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli akuti nnyi, ‘Nankopwesye ku Misili kumwaliji achikapolo, <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />nammombwele kutyochela mu utawala wa Ŵamisili ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵamenyene ni ŵanyamwe mu chilambo chi, ni une naaŵinjile ŵanyawo mu chilambo chi ni kumpa ŵanyamwe chilambo chi chiŵe chenu.’ <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Nipele nansalile kuti, ‘Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwenu, nkajipopelela minungu ja Ŵaamoli, ŵankutama nawo mu chilambo chao. Nambo nganimumbilikanichisya.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajawile kukutama paasi pa chitela chekulungwa cha mwaloni chichaliji chi che Yoashi jwa lukosyo lwa Abieseli ku musi wa ku Ofila. Che Gidioni mwanagwe che Yoashi ŵaliji nkupeeta ngano peuto pakuminyila sabibu, ŵalijuŵile kuti Ŵamidiani akaawona. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵankopochele che Gidioni ni ŵansalile, “Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni mmwe, mmwe mundu jwangajogopa.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Che Gidioni ŵammusisye “Alakwe achimwene, iŵaga Ambuje Akunnungu ali pamo ni uwe, ana ligongo chichi indu yose yi itusimene? Ana gali kwapi masengo gao gakusimosya gaŵatusalile achinangolo ŵetu paŵatusalile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatuichisye akuno kutyochela ku Misili? Nambo sambano atulesile nombejo atutesile tuputikwe ni Ŵamidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangalauchile ni kunsalila, “Njaule kwa machili ganlinago, nkaawombole Ŵaisilaeli kutyochela kwa Ŵamidiani. Uneji ni junguntuma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Che Gidioni ŵanjanjile “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu chinaakulupusye chinauli Ŵaisilaeli? Ntundu wangu nganiukola machili gakuputana ngondo kujipunda mitundu jose ja mu lukosyo lwa Manase, ni une nansyene ngangumanyika pannango wa atati ŵetu.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile “Nkukombola kuitenda yeleyo pakuŵa une tinjinkamuchisya. Tinjintenda mwaulaje Ŵamidiani pangalema mpela mkuulaga mundu jumo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Che Gidioni ŵansalile, “Iŵaga ngundikwe paujo penu munosye chimanyisyo pakuti manyilile kuti mmwe kusyene nli Ambuje Akunnungu junkuŵecheta ni une. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Choonde nkatyoka mpaka pachimuje ni kunnyichisya ntuuka wangu.” Nombejo ŵajanjile “Chindame pelepa mpaka pachimmuje.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Pelepo che Gidioni ŵajinjile mu nyuumba jakwe, ŵateleche nyama ja kandembe ka mbusi, nipele ŵajigele utandi kilo kumi ni kukolosya mikate jangataga amila, ŵatasile nyama jo ni mikate mu chitundu ni nsusi mu chiteleko, nipele ŵampelechele katumetume jo kuusi kwa chitela cha mwaloni ni ŵaŵisile paujo pakwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Akunnungu jo ŵansalile, “Njigale nyama ni mikate jangataga amila njiŵiche pa lwala lu ni mjitilile nsusi wo pachanya pakwe.” Nombe che Gidioni ŵatesile yeleyo, <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Pelepo katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajikwaiye nyama ni mikate jila ni songa ja lubokola luŵalujigele mmakono mwakwe, mooto wakopochele mu lwala mula ni kuitinisya indu ila. Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu nganawoneka paujo pakwe.<verse eid="JDG 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Che Gidioni paŵaimanyilile kuti jwejula ŵaliji katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵagumisile, ni ŵatite, “Nguwa une, Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu! Pakuŵa nammweni katumetume jwa kwinani Ambuje Akunnungu kwa meeso gangu!”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Mme ni chitendewele! Nkajogopa. Ngammwa.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Che Gidioni ŵalumbikenye maganga ni kuntaŵile Ambuje Akunnungu peuto pakupelechele mbopesi, ni kupaŵilanga peuto po, “Ambuje Akunnungu ali chitendewele.” Peuto pakupelechela mbopesi po pali ku Ofila, musi wa Ŵaabieseli mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Chilo cho Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Gidioni “Njigale ng'ombe jankambaku ja atati ŵenu, ajila ng'ombe jaaŵili ja yaka saba. Ngumulanye peuto pakupelechela mbopesi kwa nnungu Baali paataŵile atati ŵenu ni kuchikasanya chinyago cha nnungu Ashela chachili mumbali mwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Nipele, muundaŵile une Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu peuto pakupelechelela mbopesi pachanya chikwesya chi mpela yaikuti kusachilwa. Nipele muumbelechele mbopesi jakutinisya ja ng'ombe jaaŵili jila, kwa sasu sya sichi sya achila chinyago cha Ashela chimwachikasenye.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Nipele che Gidioni ŵaajigele ŵandu likumi pasikati ja ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, ŵatesile mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵannajichisye. Nambo pakuŵa ŵaajogwepe ŵamu nyuumba ja atatigwe ni ŵandu ŵa mu mmusi, nganakombola kutenda yeleyo muusi, pamalo pakwe ŵaitesile chilo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Ŵandu ŵaakutama mmusi mo paŵajimwiche kundaŵipe ŵapaweni peuto pakupelechela mbopesi kwa nnungu Baali ni chinyago cha Ashela chichaliji muumbali mwakwe yekasanye. Ng'ombe jankambaku jaaŵili jili jetinisye pachanya peuto pakupelechela mbopesi papataŵikwe pelepo. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Ŵausyeneusyene, “Ana ŵani ŵatesile yelei?” Paŵauchilichisye kwannope ŵasalilwe, “Che Gidioni mwanagwe che Yoashi ni juŵatesile yeleyo.” <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Ŵaakutama mmusi mo ŵansalile che Yoashi, “Munnyichenawo mwanagwenu tummulaje, pakuŵa agumwile pamalo pakupelechela mbopesi kwa nnungu Baali ni kuchikasanya chinyago cha Ashela chichaliji mumbali mwakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Che Yoashi ŵaasalile ŵandu uŵakanganaga nawo ŵala, “Ana nkusaka kunchenjela nnungu Baali? Uli nkukombola kunkulupusya? Jwalijose jwaakunchenjela Baali aulajikwe nganikuche. Iŵaga Baali ali Akunnungu munneche alichenjele nsyene pakuŵa liuto lyakwe lyakutyochesya mbopesi ligumulikwe.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Nipele kutandilila lyuŵa lyo ŵammilasile che Gidioni, “Yelubaali,” achitiji “Munneche Baali alichenjele nsyene. Pakuŵa peuto pakwe pakupelechela mbopesi pagumulikwe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Katema ko Ŵamidiani ni Ŵaamaleki ni ŵandu ŵane ŵa kungopochelo lyuŵa ŵasongangene, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni kuŵika igono yao mu chiŵata kuusi kwa itumbi kwele ku Yesileeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Nipele mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannyichilile che Gidioni, ni che Gidioni ŵagombile lipenga kwaŵilanga ŵangondo kutyochele mu ntundu wa Ŵaabieseli kuti ŵaakuye. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Sooni ŵaatumile ŵantenga ajaule ku chilambo chose cha Manase kwaŵilanga ŵangondo kuti ankuye, ni sooni ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa ngosyo sya Asheli ni Sabuloni ni Nafutali, ni ŵanyawo nombe ŵaiche kukulumbikana nawo.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Che Gidioni ŵansalile Akunnungu, “Ntite kuti timuundende une naawombole Ŵaisilaeli, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />sambano nguŵika lipende lya ngondolo paluŵala lwa kupetela ngano, patikucheje iŵaga tipaŵe pana mangame pa lipende pepo ngaŵa ni pa luŵala pakwe, pelepo timanyilile kuti timuundende une naakulupusye Ŵaisilaeli mpela intite kusala.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Yeleyo ni iyatendekwe, pakuŵa che Gidioni paŵajimwiche kundaŵipe ŵagaweni maangame pa lipende, ŵaminyile lipende lila, maangame gakopweche ni meesi gagumbele mu bakuli. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Che Gidioni ŵansalile Akunnungu, “Choonde ngasimundumbilila, angunde kuti nammende chindu chine. Ngummenda muluusu nanninje sooni kwa lipende lilili. Ulendo wu ngummenda lipende pe liŵe lyakuumula ni paluŵala paŵe ni mangame.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Chele chilo cho Akunnungu ŵatesile iyoyo, pachanya lipende paliji papajumu ni paluŵala paliji ni mangame.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Che Gidioni akwapunda Ŵamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Yelubaali, liina lyakwe liine che Gidioni ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ŵalaŵile kwimuka ni kwaula kuŵika chigono kuchiŵata chiŵandika ni uliŵa wa Halodi, ni chigono cha Ŵamidiani chaliji chakumpoto kwao, kuchiŵata, chiŵandika ni chitumbi cha Mole.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Gidioni, “Aŵa ŵandu ŵaali pamo ni mmwe atupile kwannope, kwa une kwapundisya kwa Ŵamidiani. Ŵaisilaeli akaika kulilapa ni kusala kuti alikulupwisye achinsyene kwa machili gao ni ngaŵa une unaakamuchisye. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Sambano mwatangachisye ŵandu kuti, ‘Jwalijose jwakogopa pane kutetemela atyoche apano pa chitumbi cha Gileadi, auje mmangwawo.’ ” Pelepo, ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili ŵausile mmangwawo, ŵasigele ŵandu elufu kumi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Gidioni, “Mpaka sambano ŵandu ŵaali pamo ni mmwe atupile kwannope, ntuluchenawo mwaichisye kugali meesi ni une tinaalinje kweleko kwaligongo lyenu. Mundu juchinansalile kuti mundu ju nnonganenawo, jwelejo chinnonganenawo, nambo mundu juchinansalile nkalongananawo, jwelejo nkalongananawo.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Nipele che Gidioni ŵajawile nawo ŵandu ŵala ku lusulo ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Ŵandu ŵachalapite meesi ni lulimi nti mmbwa mwalekanganye ni aŵala ŵachang'we meesi ali atindiŵele.”<verse eid="JDG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Ŵandu ŵaŵang'wele meesi kwa kulapita nti mmbwa ŵaliji mia tatu, nambo ŵandu ŵane ŵaŵasigalile wose ŵang'wele meesi ali atindiŵele.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Gidioni, “Tinjinkulupusya mmweji ni kumpundisya kwa Ŵamidiani ni ŵandu mia tatu ŵaŵalapite meesi nti mmbwa. Mwasalile ŵandu ŵane wose ajaule kila mundu kunyuumba jakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Nipele che Gidioni ŵaalesile Ŵaisilaeli ŵane ajaule kila mundu ku lisakasa lyakwe. Ŵasigalile ni aŵala ŵandu mia tatu ŵaŵajigele yakulya ni mapenga ga achinjawo ŵaŵatyosile ŵala. Chigono cha Ŵamidiani chaliji chakwiŵanda kwa che Gidioni ni ŵangondo ŵakwe.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Chilo cho Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Gidioni, “Njimuche, ntuluche ku chigono chao nkaagungumuchile ni une chinantende mwapunde ŵandu wo. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Nambo iŵaga nkogopa kwaula kwagungumuchila, nlongane ni jwakutumichila jwenu che Pula kwaula ku chigono chao. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Kweleko chinkapikane yaakuŵechetanga ni pakumala pelepo chinkole machili gakwagungumuchila.” Nipele che Gidioni pamo ni che Pula, jwakutumichila jwakwe, ŵatulwiche mpaka pamalo paŵaliji ŵakulindilila ŵa pa chigono cha Ŵamidiani.<verse eid="JDG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Ŵamidiani ni Ŵaamaleki ni ŵandu wose kutyochela kungopochelo lyuŵa, ŵajenele kwiŵanda, nombewo ŵaliji achajinji nti sombe ni ŵakwete ngamia syejinji syangaŵalanjikwa, nti nsanga wa kumbwani.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Che Gidioni paŵaiche, ŵampikene mundu ali nkunsalila njakwe sagamisi jiŵasagamile. Ŵatite, “Nasagamile, nauweni nkate wa shayili uli nkugalambuka ni kugwilila pa chigono cha Ŵamidiani, ni waliputile lisakasa limo ni lisakasa lyo lyapitikwiche ni kugwa paasi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Njakwe jula ŵajanjile, “Sagamisi jo jikusala nkati aula upanga wa ajula che Gidioni mwanagwe che Yoashi mundu jwa ku Isilaeli. Akunnungu antesile ŵaapunde Ŵamidiani ni ŵangondo ŵetu wose.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Che Gidioni paŵajipilikene sagamisi jo ni kugopolela kwakwe, ŵatindiŵele ni kwapopelela Akunnungu. Ŵausile ku chigono cha Ŵaisilaeli ni kwasalila, “Njimuchanje twende pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu atutesile twapunde ŵangondo ŵa Chimidiani.”<verse eid="JDG 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Nipele ŵaasapulenye aŵala ŵangondo mia tatu pa mipingo jitatu, kila mundu ŵampele lipenga ni lulo lwangali meesi, lweŵiche lumuli lwalukukolela nkati mwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Ŵaasalile, “Muunolechesye itindende, patingaiche chiŵandi ni chigono, ni ŵanyamwe nkatendeje mpela itindende. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Une ni ŵamumpingo wangu, pachitugombe mapenga getu, ni ŵanyamwe wose ngombeje kusyungula chigono chose nchisalaga, ‘Mputane kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu! Mputane kwaligongo lya che Gidioni!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Kuŵandichila chilo nnope, che Gidioni ni mpingo wa ŵangondo mia moja uŵaliji pamo nawo ŵala ŵaiche mumbali mwa chigono cha ŵammagongo. Katema ko ŵakulindilila ŵaŵaliji nkulindilila ŵaliji nkutyoka kuti ajinjile ŵane. Pelepo che Gidioni ni achinjakwe ŵagombile mapenga gao ni kukasanya lulo sisyaliji mmakono mwao.<verse eid="JDG 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Ni mipingo jine jila jatesile iyoyo peyo. Ŵakamulile imuli ku nkono wakunchiji ni kunkono wakunlyo, ŵakamulile mapenga ni kugomba, akuno achinyanyisyaga achitiji, “Mputane ni lipanga kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu, mputane ni lipanga kwaligongo lya che Gidioni!”<verse eid="JDG 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Jwangondo jwalijose ŵajimi pamalo pakwe kusyungula chigono. Ŵangondo wose ŵa Ŵamidiani ŵautwiche ali nkugumilanga.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Ŵangondo ŵa che Gidioni paŵaliji nkugomba mapenga gao mia tatu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatesile Ŵamidiani aulagane achinsyene pe ni mapanga pa chigono pala. Ŵane ŵaŵasigalile ŵajumi ŵala ŵatolochele ku Selela, ŵaiche kwakutalichila nnope mpaka ku Beti Shita ni mpaka mumpika wa ku musi wa Abeli Mehola chiŵandika ni musi wa Tabati.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵa lukosyo lwa Nafutali ni lukosyo lwa Asheli ni lukosyo lwa Manase wose, ŵaŵilanjikwe ŵaatopole Ŵamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Che Gidioni ŵaatumile ŵantenga mulimose ku chilambo cha itumbi cha Efulaimu akaasalile kuti, “Mwaasalile ŵangondo atuluche akaapute Ŵamidiani ni kwasiŵila kuti akajomboka sulo syamwana ni lusulo lwa Yolodani mpaka ku Beti Bala kwa kwasumula mwakombochela.” Kwayele achalume wose ŵa ku Efulaimu wasongangene ni kusumula lusulo lwa Yolodani mpaka ku Beti Bala. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Iyoyo peyo ŵaakamwile ilongola ŵaŵili ŵa Ŵamidiani, che Olebu ni che Seebu. Che Olebu ŵammulajile palapala pa lwala lwa Olebu ni che Seebu ŵammulajile pa luŵala lwakuminyila sabibu lwa Seebu. Nipele ŵajendelechele kwaakuilichisya Ŵamidiani, ni ŵajiichisye mitwe ja che Olebu ni che Seebu kwa che Gidioni juŵaliji peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Ŵamidiani akulepela kusyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Nipele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu ŵammusisye che Gidioni, “Kwachichi ntutesile yelei? Kwachichi nganintuŵilanga pamwajaulaga kukumenyana ni Ŵamidiani?” Ŵanyawo ŵandandaulile kwannope.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Nambo che Gidioni ŵajanjile, “Indu indesile une ngaŵa chindu pakuilandanya aila intesile ŵanyamwe. Aila intesile mwanya Ŵaefulaimu ili yekulungwa kuipunda aila yatesile ŵandu ŵangu ŵa ntundu wa Abieseli. <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Akunnungu antesile mwanya mwapunde ŵele mamwenye ŵaŵili ŵa Chimidiani, che Olebu ni che Seebu. Ana une ndesile ichichi chakulandanya ni ŵanyamwe?” Che Gidioni paŵaŵechete yeleyo Ŵaefulaimu ŵatulele ni nganajendelechela kutumbila.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Katema ko che Gidioni ni ŵangondo ŵakwe mia tatu ŵaiche ku lusulo lwa Yolodani ni ŵajombweche, ŵaliji apesile kwannope, nambo ŵajendelechele kwakuilichisya Ŵamidiani.<verse eid="JDG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Paŵaiche ku Sukoti, che Gidioni ŵaasalile ilongola ŵa musi wo, “Choonde mwapanje ŵangondo ŵangu chakulya, pakuŵa apesilenje kwannope ni uneji ndili nkwakuilisya mamwenye ŵa ku Midiani che Seba ni che Salimuna.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Nambo ilongola ŵa ku Sukoti ŵammusisye, “Kwachichi kwapa chakulya ŵangondo ŵenu akuno che Seba ni che Salimuna nganimme kwakamula?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Che Gidioni ŵaasalile, “Mwambone, nambo Ambuje Akunnungu patachingamuchisya naakamule che Seba ni che Salimuna, tinjiuja pelepa, chinjimputa mwanya ni kwapalamula ilu yenu kwa miiŵa ya mmatinji ni michongwe.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Paŵatyosile kweleko ŵajawile ku Penueli kukwaŵenda chakulya ŵandu ŵa kweleko. Nambo ŵandu ŵa ku Penueli ŵajanjile mwakulandana ni ŵandu ŵa ku Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Che Gidioni ŵaasalile, “Patinjiuja ndili naapundile mamwenye wo, tinjigumula lusonga lwenu.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Nipele che Seba ni che Salimuna ŵaliji ku Kalikoli ni ŵangondo ŵao elufu kumi na tano. Ŵeleŵa ni ŵangondo ŵaŵasigalile mwa ŵangondo wose ŵaŵatyochele ku ngopochelo lyuŵa, pakuŵa achinjawo laki moja ni elufu ishilini ŵaulajikwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Che Gidioni ŵakwesile achilikuyaga litala liŵapitaga ŵakusamasama, lilyaliji chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Noba ni ku Yogibeha ni ŵaagungumuchile ŵangondo wo mwachisisimuchile. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Mamwenye ŵa ku Midiani wo, che Seba ni che Salimuna ŵatolweche, nambo che Gidioni ŵaakuiye ni kwakamula, ni mpingo wose wa ŵangondo ŵa mamwenye wo ŵajinjilwe ni woga.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Che Gidioni mwanagwe che Yoashi ŵausile kutyochela ku ngondo achipitaga pamalo pakupita papakuŵilanjikwa Helesi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Kweleko ŵankamwile nchanda jumo jwa ku Sukoti ni kummusya. Nchanda jo ŵannembele che Gidioni meena sabini na saba ga ilongola ni achachekulu ŵakumanyika ŵa musi wo. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Che Gidioni ŵajawile kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Sukoti ni kwasalila “Nkumbuchile pamwandukene nchitiji ‘Kwachichi kwapa chakulya ŵangondo ŵenu ŵaapesile kwannope, akuno che Seba ni che Salimuna nganimme kwakamula?’ Hayaga etu, che Seba ni che Salimuna aŵapa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Nipele ŵaakamwile ilongola ŵa ku Sukoti ni kwapalamula ilu yao kwakwaputa ni miiŵa ni michongwe kwajamuka ilongola wose ŵa ku Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Nombe ŵagumwile lusonga lwa ku Penueli ni kwaulaga achalume wose ŵaakutama mmusi wo.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Nipele ŵaausisye che Seba ni che Salumuna, “Ana aŵala ŵandu ŵamwaauleje ku Taboli ŵaonekaga chantiuli?” Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Ŵawonekaga mpela mmwe, pakuŵa jwalijose jwaonekaga mpela mwanache jwa mwenye.” <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Che Gidioni ŵaajanjile “Ŵanyawo ŵaliji achapwanga, ŵalutumbo lumo. Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajumi, ngankaauleje, ni une jwakwe ngangammulaje.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Nipele ŵansalile che Yeteli, mwanagwe jwakwitiwo, “Njime mwaulaje!” Nambo che Yeteli nganalisolomola lipanga lyao, ŵajogwepe pakuŵa ŵaliji jwannondi. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Pelepo che Seba ni che Salimuna ŵatite, “Ntuulaje mwasyene pakuŵa gelega gali masengo ga mundu jwakusile.” Che Gidioni ŵaauleje nsyene ni kwigala yakusalalisya iyaliji mu ngosi sya ngamia syao.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ŵansalile che Gidioni, “Mmwe mmeje ntawala jwetu, ni patinchiwa mmwe, iŵelesi yenu atawaleje, pakuŵa mmwejo ntukulupwisye ni Ŵamidiani.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Che Gidioni ŵaajanjile, “Une ngaama ntawala jwenu kose namose iŵelesi yangu ngasantawala ŵanyamwe. Ambuje Akunnungu ni juchaŵe ntawala jwenu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Che Gidioni ŵaasalile sooni “Ngummendanga chindu chimo, mundu jwalijose ambe ileleni yaasumwile kwa mateeka.” Ŵamidiani ŵala pakuŵa ŵaliji Ŵaishumaeli ŵaliji awasile ileleni ya sahabu mmawiwi mwao. <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Ŵandu ŵanjanjile, “Chitumpe kwakusaka kwetu achinsyene.” Ŵatandiche nguo ni ŵanawose ŵaŵisile ileleni iŵasumwile. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Utopele wa ileleni yose iŵampele waliji mpela kilogilamu ishilini. Kupunda ni yeleyo, ŵapochele ipini ni yakuwala ya sambalau iyawalikwaga ni mamwenye wa ku Midiani, ni mikufu jijaliji mu ngosi sya ngamia syao. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Che Gidioni ŵajitumie sahabu jo kolosya chindu chichikulandana ni nguo jakuwala pantima jiŵawalaga ŵambopesi ŵa ku Isilaeli, ŵachiŵisile ku musi wakwe wa Ofila. Ŵaisilaeli ŵajaulaga kweleko kukuchipopelela chindu cho, ni chaliji chitanje kwa che Gidioni ni kwa ŵamu nyuumba jakwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Kwayele Ŵamidiani ŵaputikwe ni Ŵaisilaeli, ni nganiŵaasausya sooni Ŵaisilaeli. Chilambo chaliji ni chitendewele kwa yaka alobaini katema kose che Gidioni paŵaliji ŵajumi.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Gidioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Nipele che Gidioni, liina lyakwe liine ŵaŵilanjikwe Yelubaali juŵaliji mwanagwe che Yoashi, ŵaujile kumangwakwe ni kutama kweleko. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Che Gidioni ŵakwete ŵanache sabini ŵachilume, pakuŵa ŵalombele achakongwe ŵajinji. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Sooni, che Gidioni ŵakwete chilanga kwele ku Shekemu juŵammelechele mwanache jwachilume, mwanache jo ŵammilasile Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Che Gidioni mwanagwe che Yoashi ŵawile ali achekulwipe kwannope, ŵansichile pa lilembe lya che Yoashi atatigwe ku musi wa Ofila, musi wa mtundu wa Abieseli.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Paŵawile che Gidioni, papopo Ŵaisilaeli ŵajiujilile inyango ya minungu ja Baali ni kujipopelela. Ŵantesile Baali Beliti kuŵa nnungu jwao. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵanliŵalile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwao, juŵaawombwele ni ŵammagongo ŵao ŵakwasyungulila mosemose. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Sooni, nganapanganya indu yambone kwa ŵamunyuumba ja Yelubaali, liina lyakwe liine jwaŵilanjikwe che Gidioni pa yambone yose iŵaapangnyichisye Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Che Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Pa lyuŵa limo, che Abimeleki mwanagwe che Gidioni ŵajawile kwa anyanjombagwe ni achalongo ŵane ŵa achikulugwe, ŵaakutama ku Shekemu ni ŵaasalile, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Nkaausye ŵandu wose wa Kushekemu kuti, ‘Chapi chachili chambone kukwenu, kuti ŵanache wose sabini ŵa Yelubaali antawale pane kuti mundu jumo antawale? Nkumbuchilanje kuti une ni ŵanyamwe tuli miasi jimo.’” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ŵanyanjomba ŵa che Abimeleki ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu aila yose yasalilwe ni che Abimeleki, ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Shekemu ŵasagwile kwakuya che Abimeleki ligongo ŵaliji nlongo njawo. <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Ŵampele ipande sabini ya madini ga feza iyaliji ku nyuumba ja nnungu Baali Beliti, iyatumie kwalipa ŵangondo ŵauwanga kuti ŵaakamuchisye. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Ŵalongene nawo kwaula ku Ofila ku musi wa atatigwe, ni kweleko ŵaauleje achapwakwe sabini wose, ŵele ŵanache ŵa Yelubaali, pachanya lwala lumo. Nambo che Yosamu juŵaliji mwanache jwa chiwango jwa Yelubaali nganammulaga, pakuŵa ŵalijuŵile. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Nipele ŵandu wose ŵa ku Shekemu ni ku Beti Milo ŵasongangene paasi pa chitela chachikulungwa chachili chiŵandika ni liganga lya chikumbuchisyo kwele ku Shekemu ko, ni kweleko ŵantesile che Abimeleki kuŵa mwenye jwao.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Che Yosamu paŵapilikene ngani syo ŵajawile kukwima pachanya chitumbi cha Gelisimu, ŵanyanyisye kwasalila ŵandu wo kuti, “Mumbilikanile mwanya ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu, iŵaga nkusaka Akunnungu ampilikanile ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Pa lyuŵa limo, itela yajawile kukulisagulila mwenye. Nipele yachisalile chitela cha mseituni, ‘Mmwe mmeje mwenye jwetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Nambo chitela cha mseituni chajanjile, ‘Ana nkuti tinagaleche masengo gangu gakukoposya mauta gangu gagakuchimbichikwa ni minungu ni ŵandu, nyaule ngalisausye kuitawala itela?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Nipele itela yachisalile chitela cha ntini, ‘Njise mmwe, mme mwenye jwetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Nambo Ntini wajanjile, ‘Uli, neche masengo gangu gakusogosya isogosi yambone ni yakunong'a, nyaule ngalisausye kuitawala itela?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Nipele itela yo yachisalile chitela cha msabibu, ‘Njise mmwe, mme mwenye jwetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Nambo msabibu wajanjile, ‘Ana nkuganisya kuti ngukombola kuleka kukoposya divai jajikwasengwasya minungu ni ŵandu, nyaule ngalisausye kuitawala itela?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Mbesi itela yose yachisalile chitela cha miiŵa ‘Njise mmwe, mme mwenye jwetu.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Chitela cha miiŵa chajanjile, ‘Mwasakaga kusyene kuundenda mwenye jwenu, njisanje kuntame ku mbwilili wangu, nangaŵaga yeleyo, tinjikolesya mooto ukopochele pa miiŵa jangu ni kuitinisya itela ya mielesi ja ku Lebanoni.’”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Nipele che Yosamu ŵajendelechele kuti, “Ana nkuganisya nkutenda yambone ni mwakukulupilichika kunsagula che Abimeleki aŵe mwenye jwenu? Ana gelego ni malipilo ginkwalipa che Yelubaali ni ŵamu nyuumba jakwe kwa yambone yose iŵantendele? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Nkumbuchile yakuti atati ŵangu ŵanchenjele mwanya ni ŵaliji chile kuwa kwaligongo lya kunkulupusya mwanya kutyochela kwa Ŵamidiani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Nambo lelo mwagalawiche achalongo ŵa atati ŵangu, ni kwaulaga achiŵanagwe sabini pachanya pa liganga limo. Sooni muntesile che Abimeleki mwanache jwakuchilanga cha atati wangu aŵe mwenye pa ŵandu ŵaakutama ku Shekemu pakutipala nli ulongo umo. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Sambano iŵaga ntesile yeleyo ni ntima wenu wose ni kwakunchimbichisya Yelubaali ni achalongo ŵakwe, nipele ŵanyamwe munsengwasye che Abimeleki, nombe che Abimeleki ansengwasye ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Nambo, nangaŵaga yeleyo mooto ukopoche ku che Abimeleki ni kwatinisya ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu ni ku Beti Milo, sooni mooto ukopoche kwa ŵandu ŵakutama ku Shekemu ni ku Beti Milo ni kwatinisya che Abimeleki.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Nipele che Yosamu ŵautwiche ni kwaula ku Beeli. Ŵatemi kweleko ligongo ŵaajogopaga che Abimeleki mpwakwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Che Abimeleki ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka itatu. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵaatindenye che Abimeleki ni ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu, ni ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu ŵangalawiche che Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Akunnungu ŵatesile yeleyi kulipila maulago ga ŵanache sabini wa Yelubaali, gagatendekwe ni che Abimeleki paŵaauleje achapwakwe, kwa ukamuchisyo wa ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu ŵaaŵisile ŵandu penani pa matumbi, anjuŵilile che Abimeleki kuti ampute. Ŵandu wo ŵansumwile ipanje mundu jwalijose juŵapitaga lyele litala lyo, ni che Abimeleki ŵasalilwe ngani jo.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Nipele mwanache jwa che Ebedi liina lyakwe che Gaali, ŵaiche kutama ku Shekemu pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, nipele ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu ŵankulupilile jwelejo aŵe chilongola jwao. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Ŵanawose ŵakopweche ni kwaula mmigunda jao kukukaŵa isogosi ya sabibu, nipele ŵasiminyile ni kolosya divai. Nipele ŵatesile chindimba. Ŵajawile mu nyuumba ja nnungu jwao, kuŵalile ni kung'wa ni ŵantukene che Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Che Gaali mwanagwe che Ebedi ŵatite, “Ana uweji ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu tuli ŵantiuli? Kwachichi twatumichile che Abimeleki? Ana che Abimeleki ali ŵani? Jweleju ali mwanache ju che Gidioni, kwayele nganaŵa mpwetu jwa miasi, ngaikomboleka kuti aŵe mwenye jwetu ni ngatukombola kwajitichisya che Sebuli, jwammisile atutawale. Sambano chiiŵe yambone twajitichisye ŵandu ŵa munyuumba ja ambuje ŵetu che Amoli juŵaliji atati jwa Ŵashekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Naga ngaliji chilongola jwa ŵandu wose ŵa, ngaausile che Abimeleki umwenye. Ngaansalile che Abimeleki kuti, ‘Njonjechesye ŵangondo ŵenu ni nnyiche tumenyane.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Che Sebuli juŵaliji mtawala jwa musi paŵapilikene gaŵaŵechete che Ebedi, ŵatumbile kwannope. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Nipele ŵaatumile kwa chisyepela ŵantenga, ŵaapelechele che Abimeleki utenga ku Tolima wakuti, “Che Gaali mwanagwe che Ebedi pamo ni achapwakwe aiche kutama ku Shekemu, ni akwanyenga ŵandu kuti ankane mmwejo. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Nipele njise chilo mmwe pamo ni ŵandu wenu ni kwajuŵilila mmigunda chiŵandi ni musi. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Ni malaŵi kundaŵi lyuŵa palikukopoka, njimuche ni kuugungumuchila musi wo chisisimuchile. Che Gaali ni ŵandu ŵaali pamo nawo patakopoche paasa kumenyana nomwe, pelepo mwapute kwannope.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Kwapele che Abimeleki pamo ni ŵangondo ŵakwe wose ŵatyosile chilo ni kwaula ku Shekemu. Ŵaagaŵenye ŵandu ŵakwe pa mipingo ncheche, ŵalisisile kuti ŵaajuŵilile mmigunda jajili chiŵandi ni musi. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Che Gaali mwanagwe che Ebedi ŵatyosile paasa, ŵajimi pannango wekulungwa wa musi, katema ko Abimeleki ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵatyosile muŵalisisile mula. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Che Gaali paŵaweni ŵandu wo ŵansalile che Sebuli, “Nnole ŵandu akutuluka kutyochela ku songa sya matumbi.” Che Sebuli ŵanjanjile, “Mmwe nkuiwona ibwilili ya matumbi ni nkupela ali ŵandu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Che Gaali ŵatite sooni, “Nnole ŵandu akutuluchila pasikati ja chilambo ni mpingo wine ukutyochela kwakuli chitela chekulungwa chaakutumia ŵachisango.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Nipele, che Sebuli ŵansalile, “Kulifuna kwenu kuli kwapi sambano? Ana nganimma mmwe jumwatite, ‘Che Abimeleki ali ŵaani? Kwachichi twatumichile?’ Ana aŵaŵa nganaŵa ŵandu umwanyelwisye ŵala? Njauleje sambano nkamenyane nawo!” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Che Gaali ŵatyosile ni kwalongosya ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu ni kuputana ni che Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Nambo che Gaali ŵalepele ni kuutuka kwinjila mmusi, akuno che Abimeleki ali nkwakuilisya. Ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaulele ni kugwa mwitala mpaka kwika pannango wekulungwa wakwinjilila mmusi. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Nipele, che Abimeleki ŵausile ku Aluma ni che Sebuli ŵammutwisye che Gaali ni achalongo achinjakwe atyoche mu chilambo cha ku Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Lyuŵa lyaaŵili lyakwe che Abimeleki ŵapilikene kuti ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu atyosile mmusi ni kwaula mmigunda. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵakwe, ŵaagaŵenye mipingo jitatu ni kwaŵika ŵaajuŵilile mmigunda mo. Paŵaaweni ŵandu ali nkutyoka mmusi, ŵatyosile muŵalijuŵile mula, ŵaagungumuchile ni kwaulaga. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Che Abimeleki ni ŵangondo uwaliji nao ŵala ŵautwiche ni ŵajawile kwima pannango wekulungwa wa musi. Ŵaasiŵile ŵandu akauja ni kwinjila mmusi. Mipingo jine jiŵili jila ŵaajaulile aŵala ŵaŵaliji mmigunda ni kwaulaga wose. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Ngondo jajendelechele lyuŵa lila tetete. Che Abimeleki ŵaujigele musi ula, ŵaauleje ŵandu wose mwelemo, ni ŵagumwile majuumba gose ni kukusulila njete pa lisi lyose lya musi wo.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Nipele ilongola uŵaliji nkutama ku lusonga lwa ku Shekemu paŵapilikene ngani ji, ŵautuchile kukulisisa mu likome lya nyuumba ja nnungu jwakuŵilanjikwa Baali Beliti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Che Abimeleki ŵasalilwe kuti ilongola wose ŵaakutama ku lusonga lwa ku Shekemu asongangene pamo. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Che Abimeleki pamo ni ŵangondo uŵaliji nawo, ŵakwesile kwaula ku chitumbi cha Salumoni, che Abimeleki ŵajigele liŵago ŵakatile lujambi lumo ni kulujigala pekoyo pakwe. Nipele ŵaalajisye ŵandu uŵaliji pamo nawo ajanguye kutenda mpela muŵatesile. <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Mundu jwalijose ŵakatile lujambi nti iŵakatile che Abimeleki. Ŵajigele nyambi syao ni kusijimika pa likumba lya likome, ŵatasile mooto kuti achome likome lyo ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji pa likome lyo ŵawile. Ŵandu wose achalume kwa achakongwe nti ŵandu elufu moja ŵawile.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Nipele che Abimeleki ŵajawile ku Tebesi, ŵausungwile musi wo ni kuujigala kwamachili. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Nambo nkati musi wo kwaliji ni lusonga lwakulimbangana, ni ŵandu wose ŵa musi wo achalume kwa achakongwe ŵautuchile mwelemo ni kuliugalila. Ŵakwesilenje pa chipagala cha lusonga lo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Che Abimeleki ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaiche kuti alugungumuchila lusonga lo, nipele ŵaiche pannango wakwinjilila ku lusonga kuti auchome mooto. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Nambo jwankongwe jumo juŵaliji kulusonga kula ŵamponyele che Abimeleki lisyago, ni lyamputile che Abimeleki pantwe ni kasanya ntwe wakwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Nipele kwachitema che Abimeleki ŵammilasile nchanda juŵanjigalilaga yakumenyanila yakwe, ni kunsalila, “Nsolomole lipanga lyenu muumulaje, ŵandu akajila kuti jwankongwe aamuleje une.” Nipele nchanda jo ŵasolomwele lipanga lyakwe ŵansomile, nombejo ŵawile. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵaiweni kuti che Abimeleki awile, ŵatyosile ni kila mundu ŵausile kumangwakwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Yeleyi ni iŵatite Akunnungu kwauchisya che Abimeleki, kwa aila yachigongomalo iŵaatendele atatigwe, apala paŵaauleje achapwakwe sabini. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Iyoyo peyo, Akunnungu ŵaajamwiche ŵandu ŵa ku Shekemu kwa chigongomalo chao chakwakamuchisya che Abimeleki. Kwayele kulwesya ku che Yosamu mwanagwe Yelubaali kwaasimene.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Paŵawile che Abimeleki, che Tola mwanagwe che Pua, chisukulu chi che Dodo, jwa lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵajimi kwakulupusya Ŵaisilaeli. Che Tola ŵatamaga ku Shamili chilambo cha matumbi cha ku Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Jwele ŵaliji chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka ishilini na tatu, paŵawile, ŵansichile ku Shamili.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Yaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Paŵawile che Tola, che Yaili jwa ku Gileadi ni juŵalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Che Yaili ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume salasini ŵaŵaliji nkukwela mbunda salasini. Ni ŵanyawo ŵakwete misinda salasini jajikuŵilanjikwa Hawoti Yaili mpaka lelo jino, ni misinda jo jili mu chilambo cha ku Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Paŵawile che Yaili ŵansichile kwele ku Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakulamula che Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaleŵele Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵajipopelele minungu Baali ni Ashitaloti, ni minungu ja ŵandu ŵa ku Alamu ni ku Sidoni ni ku Moabu ni ku Amoni ni Ŵafilisiti. Ŵaisilaeli ŵannesile Ambuje Akunnungu ni nganampopelela sooni. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Kwapele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaatesile Ŵafilisiti ni Ŵaamoni ŵaapunde Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Kwa yaka kumi na nane ŵanyawo ŵaalagesye ni kwaliŵatila Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵatamaga kwele ku Gileadi, ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoli, chachili chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Ŵaamoni nombewo ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani kumenyana ni ngosyo sya Yuda ni Benjamini ni Efulaimu. Ŵaisilaeli ŵalasile kwannope.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵaalilile Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Tunneŵele, pakuŵa tunnesile mmwe Akunnungu ŵetu ni kwapopelela nnungu Baali.” <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajanjile Ŵaisilaeli, “Uli, ana une nganinammombola mwanya kwa Ŵamisili ni Ŵaamoni ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵafilisiti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Ŵasidoni ni Ŵaamaleki ni Ŵaamoni ŵanliŵatile, ni mwanya mwandilile, ana une nganinammombola kwa ŵanyawo? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Nambo ŵanyamwe muunesile une ni kujipopelela minungu jine, kwayele ngangummombola sooni. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Njaulangane nkajililile minungu jinjisagwile jo. Njileche jele minungu jo jimmombole mmasauko genu.”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Nambo Ŵaisilaeli ŵansalile Ambuje Akunnungu, “Tutesile sambi, ntutende yailiyose inkuisaka, nambo lelo jino choonde ntuwommbole.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ni ŵajityosisye minungu ja chilendo ni kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu, nipele Ambuje Akunnungu nganakombola kupililila sooni kugawona masauko ga Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Nipele Ŵaamoni ŵasongangene ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Gileadi. Ŵaisilaeli nombe ŵasongangene ni kuŵika chigono chao kwele ku Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ni ilongola ŵao ŵausyene, “Ana ŵani ŵachalongolele kukuputana ngondo ni Ŵaamoni? Juchalongolele tachiŵa chilongola pa ŵandu wose ŵakutama ku Gileadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Nipele kwele ku Gileadi ko, jwapali mundu juŵaŵilanjikwe che Yefuta, jwelejo ŵaliji mundu jwakombola kumenyana ngondo, mwanache jwa jwankongwe jwakulaŵalaŵa ni atatigwe ŵaŵilanjikwe che Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Che Gileadi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane kwa ŵankwakwe, ni ŵele ŵanache wo paŵakusile ŵantopwele che Yefuta pa nyuumba po ni kunsalila, “Mmwejo ngampata chilichose mwa chipanje cha atati ŵetu ligongo mmwejo mwanache jwammaukutu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Nipele che Yefuta ŵaautwiche achalongo ŵakwe ŵala, ŵajawile kutama ku chilambo cha Tobu. Kweleko ŵandu ŵangakugajitichisya malajisyo ŵasongangene kuti akamulane ni jwelejo, ni ŵankuiye mu ulendo wakwe.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Kanyuma, Ŵaamoni ŵaagungumuchile Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Payakopochele yeleyo, ilongola ŵa ku Gileadi ŵajawile kukwajigala che Yefuta ku achila chilambo cha ku Tobu, <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />ŵansalile, “Nnyiche ntulongosye, patukuputana ni Ŵaamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Nambo che Yefuta ŵaasalile, “Uli, nganimma ŵanyamwe umwaamenjile ni kuundopola ku nyuumba ja atati ŵangu? Kwachichi nkuuichila une sambano nli mmalagasyo?” <verse eid="JDG 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Ilongola ŵa ku Gileadi ŵala ŵansalile che Yefuta, “Nkaikosya yeleyo, tunnyichilile mmwejo sambano kuti nlongane ni uwe nkatukamuchisye kuputana ni Ŵaamoni. Nomwe chituntende chilongola jwetu ni jwa ŵandu wose ŵakutama ku Gileadi.” <verse eid="JDG 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Che Yefuta ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga nkuumusya ku Gileadi kukuputana ni Ŵaamoni, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu iŵaga taandendekasye naapunde, uli, kusyene chinjiŵa chilongola jwenu?” <verse eid="JDG 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Ilongola ŵa ku Gileadi ŵala ŵanjanjile che Yefuta, “Ambuje Akunnungu ali jwaumboni pasikati jetu, kusyene chitutende mpela itutite pakusala.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Kwayele che Yefuta ŵalongene ni ilongola ŵa ku Gileadi, ni ŵanyawo ŵantesile chilongola jwao ni jwankulu jwa ŵangondo. Nipele che Yefuta ŵaŵechete aila yasachileje kuti apanganye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ku Misipa ko.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Nipele, che Yefuta ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa mwenye jwa Ŵaamoni, akaasalile, “Ana chinkukangana ni uwe ni ichichi? Ligongo chichi nnyiche kuchigungumuchila chilambo chetu?” <verse eid="JDG 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Mwenye jwa Ŵaamoni ŵaajanjile ŵantenga ŵa che Yefuta ŵala, “Ŵaisilaeli paŵatyosile ku Misili ŵasumwile chilambo changu kutandilila lusulo lwa Alinoni kwichila lusulo lwa Yaboki mpaka lusulo lwa Yolodani. Sambano mumuchisye chilambo changu kwa chitendewele.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Che Yefuta ŵaatumile sooni ŵantenga kwa mwenye jwa Ŵaamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />ŵansalile, “Che Yefuta akuti nyi, ‘Ŵaisilaeli nganasumula chilambo cha Ŵamoabu namose chilambo cha Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Nambo Ŵaisilaeli paŵatyosile ku Misili ŵajesile kupitila mu ukweti mpaka ku bahali ja Shamu ni kwika ku Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa mwenye jwa ku Edomu ŵaalechelele apite mu chilambo mwakwe, nambo mwenye jwa Ŵaedomu ŵakanile. Nipele ŵaaŵendile mwenye jwa Ŵamoabu kuti apite mu chilambo mwakwe, nombejo ŵakanile. Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatemi kwele ku Kadeshi ko. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Nipele ŵaapite mu ukweti, ŵajesile kusyungulila chilambo cha Edomu ni chilambo cha Moabu, ni ŵapite kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa chilambo cha Moabu, ŵaŵisile chigono peesi pa lisi lya lusulo lwa Alinoni. Ŵaisilaeli nganajomboka lusulo lwa Alinoni kwinjila ku Moabu pakuŵa lusulo lwa Alinoni ni uwaliji mpika wa chilambo cha ku Moabu. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵaatumile ŵantenga ajaule ku che Sihoni mwenye jwa Ŵaamoli, juŵatawalaga ku Heshiboni kukwaŵenda ŵaalechelele apite mu chilambo chakwe pakwaula mu chilambo chao. <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Nambo che Sihoni nganiŵaakulupilila Ŵaisilaeli ni nganiŵaaleka apite mu chilambo chakwe. Nambo ŵaasonganyisye ŵangondo ŵakwe wose ni kuŵika chigono kwele ku Yahasa, ni ŵaagungumuchile Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapundisye Ŵaisilaeli pakumputa che Sihoni ni ŵangondo ŵakwe. Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵachijigele chilambo chose cha Ŵaamoli ŵaŵatamaga mu chilambo mo. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Ŵachijigele chilambo chose cha Ŵaamoli kutandilila ku lusulo lwa Alinoni mpaka ku lusulo lwa Yaboki, ni kutyochela mu ukweti chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka chakumaswelelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵinjile Ŵaamoli paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli. Uli, sana mmwe nkusaka kutusumula chilambo chetu? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Njigale chilambo champele nnungu jwenu Kemoshi. Ni uwe wakwe, chitutame mu chilambo chatupele Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwetu. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Ana nkuganichisya kuti mmwe nkwete machili nnope kwapunda che Balaki mwanagwe che Sipola, juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Moabu? Jwelejo nganiŵaatanda Ŵaisilaeli namose nganaputana nawo ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Pakuŵa kwa yaka mia tatu Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji nkutama ku Heshiboni ni misinda jakwe, ni ku Aloeli ni misinda jakwe, ni misi jose jajili mungulugulu lusulo lwa Alinoni. Kwachichi mmwe nganinliwombola lisi lyo pa katema ko? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Une nganinanleŵela chilichose nambo mmwe ni junkuleŵa pankusaka kuputana ngondo ni une. Ambuje Akunnungu ni jwakulamula. Talamule lelo umenyani pasikati ja Ŵaisilaeli ni Ŵaamoni.’” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Nambo mwenye jwa Ŵaamoni nganagakosya maloŵe gaŵaŵechete che Yefuta.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Nipele Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jwannyichilile che Yefuta, nombejo ŵapitile pasikati ja ku Gileadi ni kulukutama lukosyo lwa Manase, ni kuuja ku Misipa mu chilambo cha Gileadi kukumenyana ni Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Ni che Yefuta ŵalilumbisye paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Iŵaga alakwe kusyene chimuundende naapunde Ŵaamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />nipele pachimuje po pakumala kwapunda Ŵaamoni, jwajulijose juchakopoche mu nyuumba jangu kwika kukuuchingamila, jwelejo chaŵe jwenu alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu. Jwelejo chinjimpelechela mmwe mbopesi jakutinisya.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Nipele che Yefuta ŵajombweche lusulo kwaula kukumenyana ni Ŵaamoni, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵantesile che Yefuta ŵaapunde Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Che Yefuta ni ŵangondo ŵakwe ŵajijigele kwa machili misi ishilini jijaliji pasikati ja Aloeli ni Miniti, ni misi jine mpaka ku Abeli Kelamimu. Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapundile kusyene Ŵaamoni.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja mwali jwa che Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Che Yefuta paŵaujaga kumangwakwe ku Misipa, mwali jwakwe ŵakopweche kukwachingamila ali nkung'anda ni kugomba kagoma ka mwana. Mwali jo ŵaliji mwanagwe jwa jikape. Che Yefuta nganakola mwanache jwine jwannume pane jwankongwe. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Che Yefuta paŵammweni ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe kulosya kulilasika, ni kulila achitiji, “Mwanangu, muundesile supuche. Mmwejo mmele ndande ja kusauka kwangu, pakuŵa uneji ndaŵile nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangu, ni une ngusachilwa ngwanilisye nasili jo.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Mwaligwe ŵanjanjile, “Atati, iŵaga ntaŵile nasili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, muundende nti intite pakwalanga, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ankamuchisye kwapunda Ŵaamoni.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Nipele ŵansalile atatigwe, “Ngummenda chindu chimo, muumbe miesi jiŵili kuti nyaule kumatumbi ni achambusanga ŵangu, ngalile kwa malumbo pakuŵa une chimwe ngunaŵe kulombekwa.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Atatigwe ŵanjanjile, “Hayaga, njaule.” Ŵanjawisye kwakutalika kwa miesi jiŵili, nombejo ŵajawile pamo ni achambusangagwe, achipitaga nkulila kwa malumbo pakuŵa chawe akanaŵe kulombekwa. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Pakumala miesi jiŵili jo ŵausile kwa atatigwe, ni atatigwe ŵantesile mpela iŵatite pakutaŵa nasili jakwe. Mwali jo ŵaliji nganawonegane ni jwannume julijose. Nipele kutandilila katema ko mu chilambo cha Kuisilaeli kwaliji ni malamusi ga: <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Kila chaka achiŵali ŵa mu Isilaeli akwaula kulila kwamalumbo kwa moŵa ncheche kuchikumbuchila chiwa cha mwali ju che Yefuta jwa ku Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Che Yefuta akuputana ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu ŵasongangene, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani ni ŵaiche ku Safoni. Nipele ŵammusisye che Yefuta, “Kwachichi nganintuŵilanga kuti tujaule pamo nomwe kukuputana ni Ŵaamoni? Sambano tutujitaje mooto nyuumba jenu mwasyene nli mmomo.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Che Yefuta ŵaasalile, “Uneji pamo ni ŵandu ŵangu twaliji ni umenyani ni Ŵaamoni. Nammilasile ŵanyamwe mungamuchisye nambo nganinnyika kukungulupusya. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Panaiweni kuti nganinnyika kukungamusya, naliji chile namose kuwa ni najombweche kwaula kukumenyana ni Ŵaamoni, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaandesile naapunde ŵanyawo. Sambano kwachichi nkuikanga kukuputana ni une?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Nipele che Yefuta ŵaasongangenye ŵandu wose ŵa ku Gileadi, ŵajawile kuputana ngondo ni Ŵaefulaimu. Ŵagileadi ŵaapundile Ŵaefulaimu, ŵele Ŵaefulaimu wo ni uŵatite kuti, “Ŵanyamwe ŵandu ŵa ku Gileadi nli ŵandu umwatolweche, kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu ni Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Pakuti ŵaasiŵilile Ŵaefulaimu akatoloka, Ŵagileadi ŵakamwile malo gakombochela lusulo lwa Yolodani. Nipele yaliji Muefulaimu jwalijose juŵasachile kutoloka paŵatite “Muuneche nyomboche,” Ŵagileadi ŵammusyaga, “Uli, mmwejo Muefulaimu?” Ajilaga “Ngwamba,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />ŵansalilaga ajile “Shiboleti.” Ajilaga “Siboleti”, kwa kulepela kusala liloŵe lyo yambone, ŵankamwile ni kummulajila papopo pa chomboko cha lusulo lwa Yolodani. Ŵaefulaimu elufu alobaini na mbili ŵaulajikwe pa kele katema ko. <verse eid="JDG 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Che Yefuta ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka sita. Nipele che Yefuta ŵawile, ŵansichile mu mmusi umo mwa misi ja ku Gileadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilongola, che Ibisani ni che Eloni ni che Abudoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Paŵawile che Yefuta, che Ibisani kutyochela ku Beselehemu ŵaliji chilongola ni jwakwalamula Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Jweleju ŵakwete ŵanache achalume salasini ni ŵanache achakongwe salasini. Ŵaalombekasisye achiŵali ŵakwe kwa ŵandu ŵangaŵa ŵa ntundu wakwe, achachanda ŵakwe nombe ŵalombele kwa ŵandu ŵangaŵa ŵa ntundu wakwe. Che Ibisani ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka saba. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Nipele, che Ibisani ŵawile, ni ŵansichile ku Beselehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Paŵaŵile che Ibisani, che Eloni jwa lukosyo lwa Sabuloni ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka likumi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Nipele che Eloni ŵawile, ŵansichile ku musi wa Aiyaloni, ku chilambo cha lukosyo lwa Sabuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Paŵawile che Eloni, che Abudoni mwana jwa che Hileli jwa musi wa ku Pilatoni ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Che Abudoni ŵakwete ŵanache achalume alobaini ni isukulu salasini ŵaŵakwesile mbunda sabini. Jweleju ŵaalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka nane. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Nipele che Abudoni mwanagwe che Hileli ŵawile, ni ŵansichile kwele ku Pilatoni ku chilambo cha Efulaimu ku matumbi ga Ŵaamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Kupagwa kwa che Sansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵanneŵele sooni Ambuje Akunnungu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaalesile Ŵafilisiti ŵaatawale kwa yaka alobaini.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Katema ko kwaliji ni mundu jumo jwa musi wa ku Tola jwa lukosyo lwa la Dani liina lyakwe che Manoa. Ŵankwakwe ŵaliji ngakuŵeleka. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Nambo pa lyuŵa limo, katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵankopochele jwankongwe jo ni kunsalila, “Nnole mmwejo ngankuŵeleka ni nganimmeleche, nambo sano chinkole chitumbo ni chimmeleche mwanache jwannume. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Nipele sambano nlilolechesye, nkang'wa divai atamuno nkologo atamuno nkalya chachilichose chachichintendekasye nkakundikwa ni Akunnungu, <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />pakuŵa tinkole chitumbo ni timmeleche mwanache jwannume. Patachipagwa mwanangwenu, nkammyola umbo syakwe, pakuŵa chaachiŵa aŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lya Akunnungu kutandilila kupagwa kwakwe. Jwelejo chachitanda kwakulupusya Ŵaisilaeli kutyochela kwa Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="JDG 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Pelepo jwankongwe jo ŵajawile ni kwasalila ŵankwakwe, “Mundu jwa Akunnungu ŵanyichilile, kumeso kwakwe kwaliji kukusimosya mpela kumeso kwa katumetume jwakwinani jwa Akunnungu. Une najogwepe kwannope, nganinammusya kuŵatyochele namose liina lyakwe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Nambo asalile kuti une tinyikute chitumbo ni kuŵeleka mwanache jwannume. Ŵasalile kuti ngasing'wa divai atamuno nkologo atamuno kulya chachilichose chachichindendekasye ngasingundikwa ni Akunnungu, ligongo kutandilila lyuŵa lichapagwe mwanache jo chaŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lya Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Pelepo che Manoa ŵapopesile kwa Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Choonde alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mundu jumuntumile jula aiche sooni kuti atujiganye yakuŵajilwa kuntendelela mwanache jo patachipagwa.” <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Akunnungu ŵampikanile che Manoa, nombe katumetume jwakwinani jwa Akunnungu ŵaiche sooni kwa jwankongwe jo paŵaliji ku migunda. Nambo che Manoa ŵankwakwe nganaŵa pamo najo. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Kwayele jwankongwe jo ŵautwiche kwakwanguya ni ŵajawile kwasalila ŵankwakwe, “Nnole! Ajula mundu juŵanyichilile alila lyuŵa lila anyichilile sooni.” <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Che Manoa ŵajimwiche ni kulongana ni ŵankwakwe. Ŵannyichilile mundu jo ni kummusya, “Ana mmwe ni mundu jumwakungulwiche ni ŵankwangu?” Mundu jo ŵajanjile, “Elo ndili une.” <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Nipele che Manoa ŵammusisye, “Sambano pitigatendekwe gelego, indu chi itutuipanganye kwa mwanache jo? Ana chapanganye masengo gachi?” <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Katumetume jwakwinani jwa Akunnungu ŵansalile che Manoa, “Ŵankwenu akusachilwa agapanganye gose ginaasalile. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Akalya chakulya chachilichose chachili ni sabibu, namose divai, namose kung'wa nkologo namose akalya chachilichose chachichatendekasye akakundikwa ni Akunnungu. Yose inaalajichisye aipanganye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Che Manoa ŵansalile katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo, “Choonde nlindilile kanondi tunkulumichisye kambusi nlye.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo ŵanjanjile, “Nachiŵamuna nkuunganganyichisya kuti ndame kanandi, uneji ngaandya chakulya chenu. Nambo mwasakaga kutyosya mbopesi jakutinisya, mbopesi jo mwatyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu.” Che Manoa nganaimanyililaga kuti jwelejo juŵakungulwiche najo jwaliji katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Nipele che Manoa ŵansalile katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo “Ntusalile liina lyenu kuti patigatendekwe ginsasile go tunchimbichisye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjanjile, “Kwachichi nkuumusya liina lyangu? Liina lyangu lili lyakusimonjeka.”<verse eid="JDG 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Pelepo che Manoa ŵakalingenye kambusi pamo ni mbopesi ja utandi, ŵaiŵisile pachanya lwala, nipele ŵantyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu. Katumetume jwakwinani jo ŵachitesile chindu chakusimosya, che Manoa ni ŵankwakwe ali nkulolechesya.<verse eid="JDG 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Kwayele, che Manoa ni ŵankwakwe paŵaalolechesyaga pamalo pakupelechela mbopesi pala, ŵammweni katumetume jwakwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu achijaulaga ni lilamba lya mooto kwaula kwinani. Che Manoa ni ŵankwakwe, ŵajineme ni kwapopelela. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Kwayele katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu nganankopochela che Manoa sooni namose ŵankwakwe. Pelepo che Manoa ni paŵaimanyilile kuti jwelejo jwaliji katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Che Manoa ŵansalile ŵankwakwe, “Kusyene uwe chituwe, ligongo twaweni Akunnungu!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Nambo ŵankwakwe ŵanjanjile, “Ambuje Akunnungu akasache kutuulaga ngakajikunde mbopesi jetu jakutinisya namose mbopesi ja utandi, namose ngakatulosye indu yi yose namose ngaakatupe malajisyo gala.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Nipele ŵankwakwe che Manoa ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume ni kwapa lina lyakwe Sansoni, mwanache jo ŵakusile, ni Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele upile. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatandite kupanganya masengo nkati mwakwe paŵatamaga ku Mahane Dani, pasikati ja Sola ni Eshitaoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Che Sansoni ni jwankongwe jwa ku musi wa Timina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Pa lyuŵa limo che Sansoni ŵajawile ku musi wa Timina, ni kweleko ŵammweni jwankongwe Mfilisiti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Paŵausile kumangwakwe ŵaasalile atatigwe ni achikulugwe, “Nammweni mwali Mfilisiti ku musi wa Timina ni ngusaka nombele jwelejo. Nkanyigalile jwelejo aŵe ŵankwangu.” <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Pelepo atatigwe ni achikulugwe ŵammusisye, “Kwachichi nkwaula kulombela kwa ŵele Ŵafilisiti ŵangaumbala? Ana nganimummona jwankongwe mu achalongo achinjenu pane pasikati ja ŵandu ŵetu wose ŵa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Nambo che Sansoni ŵansalile atatigwe, “Nkanyigalile jwelejo pakuŵa jwelejo ni jungunnonyela une.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Nambo atatigwe ni achikulugwe nganaimanyililaga kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵaŵanlongosyaga che Sansoni kuti atende yeleyi, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵasosaga ligongo lyakwaputila Ŵafilisiti, pakuŵa pa kele katema ko Ŵafilisiti ni ŵaŵaatawalaga Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Che Sansoni ŵatuluchile ku musi wa ku Timina pamo ni atatigwe ni achikulugwe. Paŵaichenje pa migunda ja misabibu kwele ku Timina ko, chisisimuchile lisimba lyakalipa lyaiche ni kwatulumila che Samsoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannyichilile che Sansoni kwa machili, ni che Sansoni ŵalikamwile lisimba lyo kukang'wa, ŵalipapachukwile kwa makono gakwe mpela mundu yakuti kukapapachukula kambusi, nambo nganaasalila atatigwe namose achikulugwe chele chiŵachitesile cho. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Nipele ŵaichenje ku musi wa Timina che Sansoni ŵapite kukukunguluka ni mwali jula, nombe mwali jula ŵaanonyelesye che Sansoni. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Pagapite moŵa kanandi che Sansoni ŵaujile ku Timina kukulombela mwali jo. Paŵaliji mwitala ŵasepwiche akalilole lisimba lila, ni ŵasimonjile piŵasiweni nyuchi sili mkutama mu ntembo wa lisimba lila ni siŵisile uchi nkati mwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Ni ŵajigele uchi wo ni kulya ali nkwenda. Ŵaaichilile atatigwe ni achikulugwe, ŵaapele uchi wo, nombe nawo ŵalile. Nambo che Sansoni nganiŵaasalila kuti ŵapakwile uchi wo mu ntembo wa lisimba.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Nipele atatigwe che Sansoni ŵajawile kumangwakwe mwali jo kukupeleka maali, ni che Sansoni ŵatesile chindimba cha yakulya kweleko, mpela achachanda iŵasyoŵelele kutenda. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Ŵafilisiti paŵammweni che Sansoni, ŵaasalile achachanda salasini akatame ni che Sansoni pa chindimba pala. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Che Sansoni ŵaasalile, “Chinansalile chitagu, mwakombolaga kuundagulila chitagu cho mu gelega moŵa saba ga ulombela ga, chinjimpa yakuwala salasini yeswela mbee ni yakuwala ine salasini. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Nambo iŵaga nkulepela kuundagulila, mwanya chimuumbe yakuwala salasini yeswela mbee ni yakuwala ine salasini.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Nipele ŵansalile, “Ntusalile chitagu chenu, tukusaka tuchipikane.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Che Sansoni ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Mu jwaakulya mwakopweche chakulya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">Mu jwamachili mwakopweche chakulyelyepela.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Niŵanyawo kwa moŵa gatatu nganakombola kutagula chitagu cho.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Nipele, pa lyuŵa lyancheche ŵansalile ŵankwakwe che Sansoni, “Mwanyenje ŵankwenu kuti atusalile malumbo ga chitagu cho, iŵaga ngankutenda yeleyo uwe tutujoche nyuumba ja atati ŵenu pamo ni mmwe wakwe nli mmomo. Ana mwanya mwatulaliche kuti ntusumule ipanje yetu?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Nipele ŵankwakwe che Sansoni ŵanjaulile che Sansoni ali nkulila ni ŵatite, “Mmwejo nkuumenga une, ngankuunonyela kose! Mmwejo mwausisye ŵandu ŵangu chitagu ni une nganimuundagulila malumbo gakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Che Sansoni ŵajanjile, “Mpilikane, atamuno atati ŵangu ni achikulu ŵangu nganinaasalila, nansalile mmwejo ligongo chichi?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Nambo ŵankwakwe che Sansoni ŵalisile kwa moŵa gose saba ga chindimba cho. Pa lyuŵa lya saba che Sansoni ŵansalile ŵankwakwe malumbo ga chitagu chila pakuŵa ŵankanganichisye nnope. Nombejo ŵajawile kukwasalila Ŵafilisiti achinjakwe malumbo ga chitagu cho. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Palyuŵa ya saba, lyuŵa likanaŵe kutiŵili, ŵandu ŵala ŵansalile che Sansoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Chichi chakulyelyepela kupunda uchi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Ŵani ŵakwete machili mpela lisimba?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Che Sansoni ŵajanjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Ngankaanyenje mwali jungulombela ju kuti amusye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">ngankachimanyilile chigopolelo cha chitagu changu.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Pelepo mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannyichilile che Sansoni kwa machili, nombejo ŵajawile ku Ashikeloni, ŵaauleje ŵandu salasini, ŵaausile yakuwala yao ya pachindimba ni kwapa aŵala ŵandu ŵaŵagopolele chitagu chakwe. Nipele ŵatyosile ni kuuja kumusi kwa achaŵelesi ŵakwe ali atumbile kwannope. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Nipele, ajula ŵankwakwe che Sansoni jula ŵanlombekasisye kwa jwanchanda jumpepe juŵaliji jwakwimilila jwa che Sansoni pa chindimba.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Pagapite moŵa gamajinji, pakatema ka magungulo ga ngano, che Sansoni wakajigele kambusi, ŵajawile kukwajimajimila ŵankwakwe. Ni ŵansalile atatigwe ŵankwakwe jo, “Ngusaka ngaalole ŵankwangu ku chuumba kwakwe.” Nambo atatigwe ŵankwakwe jula ŵankanyisye kwinjila. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Atatigwe ŵankwakwe jula ŵatite, “Uneji naatiji kuti kusyene mwachimile ŵankwenu. Kwayele nanlombekasisye kwa mmbusangagwenu. Nambo akwete mpwakwe jwakutindigala kupunda ŵankwenu. Nkukomboleka kulombela jwelejo pamalo pakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Che Sansoni ŵansalile, “Sambano ngasinsala kuti une neŵile kwa yele itinaapanganyichisye Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Nipele che Sansoni ŵajawile kugakamula makule mia tatu ni ŵagataŵile gaŵiligaŵili michila jao, ni ŵaŵisile lumuli pa michila ja kila makule gaŵiligaŵili. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Pelepo ŵapambile mimuli jo pa mooto ni kugalelechelela makule gala, nombe go gajawile mmigunda ja ngano ja Ŵafilisiti, ni ŵajochile ngano josepe, jekate ni kutaŵa ilingo ilingo ni jangakata jiŵaliji chiŵela mmigunda, ni sooni ŵachomile migunda ja miseituni nombejo. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Ŵafilisiti ŵausisye jwatesile yeleyo, ŵasalilwe kuti che Sansoni ni juŵatesile yeleyo ligongo lya atati jwa ŵankwakwe jwa ku Timina, ŵanlombekasisye ŵankwakwe kwa mmbusangagwe. Pelepo Ŵafilisiti ŵajawile ku Timina kukwatinisya mooto jwankongwe jo pamo ni atatigwe mpaka ŵawile.<verse eid="JDG 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Che Sansoni ŵaasalile Ŵafilisiti ŵala, “Pakuŵa ntesile yeleyi, ngulumbila, ngaandyoka mpaka nammuchisye.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Pelepo ŵaagungumuchile ni kwaulaga achajinji. Nipele ŵatulwiche ni kwaula kutama mu mbugu ku lwala kwele ku Etamu.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sansoni akwapunda Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaiche ni kuŵika chigono chao mu chilambo cha ku Yuda ni kuugungumuchila musi wa ku Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nnyiche kutuputa?” Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Tuiche kukwakamula che Sansoni kuti tukantende mwatutendele uwe.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Pelepo ŵandu elufu tatu ŵanjaulile che Sansoni mu mbugu ku lwala la ku Etamu ni kunsalila, “Ana ngankuimanyilila kuti Ŵafilisiti akututawala? Ana ntutesile ichichi?” Che Sansoni ŵajanjile, “Naatendele mpela yaandendele une.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Ŵansalile, “Tuiche kukunkamula kuti tunjausye kwa Ŵafilisiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Pelepo che Sansoni ŵaasalile, “Muunumbilile kuti mwanya mwachinsyene ngamumulaga.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Mwambone, uweji ngatummulaga mmwe, nambo tutunkamule ni kunjausya kwa ŵanyawo.” Nipele ŵantaŵile ni ngonji siŵili syasambano ni kunkoposya mu mbugu mo.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Che Sansoni paŵaiche ku Lehi, Ŵafilisiti ŵammutuchile ali nkunyanyisyanga. Papopo Mbumu jwa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵantasile machili che Sansoni, nipele ŵakutulenye ngonji sisyantaŵile mmakono mwakwe mpela waliji usi yaukuti kupya pa mooto. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Che Sansoni ŵaliweni liupa lya majego lya mbunda jiŵawile pangakaŵa, ŵajineme ni kulilokota ni ŵauleje nalyo ŵandu elufu moja. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Nipele che Sansoni ŵajimbile yeleyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Ni liupa lya majego lya mbunda, naauleje ŵandu elufu moja.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">Ni liupa lya majego lya mbunda munjiche mitembo ja ŵandu maunjili maunjili.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Paŵamasile kwimba, ŵajasile liupa lya majego lyo, ni pamalo po paŵilanjikwe Lamati Lehi, malumbo gakwe chitumbi cha maupa ga majego.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Nipele che Sansoni jaakamwile njota kwannope, nipele ŵaapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Alakwe Akunnungu ni jumungamuchisye kupata kupunda kwakukulungwa ku. Ana sambano nkusaka une mwe ni njota ni kukamulwa ni Ŵafilisiti ŵangaumbala ŵa?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Akunnungu ŵaugwile pamalo palili lisimbo mu chilambo cha ku Lehi ni mesi gakopweche. Che Sansoni ŵang'wele mesi go ni machili gaaujilile. Pachiliŵa po paŵilanjikwe Eni Hakole, nombepo pali kweleko mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Che Sansoni ŵaliji chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka ishilini, nambo Ŵafilisiti ŵaliji chiŵela nkutawala ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Che Sansoni ku Gasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Lyuŵa limo che Sansoni ŵajawile musi wa ku Gasa, kweleko ŵasimene ni jwankongwe jwakulaŵalaŵa, ni ŵagonile najo. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Gasa ŵamanyilile kuti che Sansoni ali kweleko, ŵasyungwile pamalo po ni kwalindilila pa nnango wekulungwa wakwinjilila mmusi chilo chose. Ŵateminji jii chilo chose achitiji “Tulindilileje mpaka kucheje, ni tummulajeje.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Nipele che Sansoni ŵagonile mpaka pasikati ja chilo. Ŵajimwiche ni ŵajawile ku chikannango chekulungwa chakwinjilila mmusi. Kweleko ŵagumwile chikannango chose pamo ni njinjili syakwe, ŵanyakulile pa makoyo gakwe ni kwaula najo mpaka ku achila chitumbi chachikulolegana ni ku Hebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Sansoni ni che Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Pakumala yeleyo, che Sansoni ŵannonyele jwankongwe jwine liina lyakwe che Delila, juŵatamaga ku chiŵata cha Soleki. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵanjaulile che Delila ni kunsalila, “Munnyenje che Sansoni kuti ansalile chichichi chachikuntendekasya akole ni machili, ni itujile kukombola kunkamula kuti tuntaŵe ni kunlagasya. Ni uweji chitumpe kila mundu ipande ya madini ga feza elufu moja na mia moja.” <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Pelepo che Delila ŵansalile che Sansoni, “Choonde muusalile chichichi chachikuntendekasya nkole machili kwanti nyi. Mundu akukombola chinauli kumpunda ni kuntaŵa?”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Che Sansoni ŵanjanjile, “Andaŵaga ni singa saba syeŵisi, sya nkunje, pelepo ni patinjiŵa ni machili mpela mundu jwine jose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Nipele ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵannyichisye che Delila singa saba syeŵisi, sya nkunje, nombejo ŵantaŵile che Sansoni ni singa syo. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Che Delila ŵaasisile ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti mu chuumba chine ŵaŵaliji nkwajuŵilila. Nipele ŵanyanyisye achinsalilaga kuti, “Che Sansoni, Ŵafilisiti akunnyichilila.” Che Sansoni ŵasikutwile singa sila nti usi wepye ni mooto. Kwayele nganapagwa juŵaimanyilile chachikwatendekasya akole ni machili.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Che Delila ŵansalile che Sansoni, “Mmwe muunambwisye ni kuundenda jwakuloŵela, sambano choonde muusalile, mundu akukombola kuntaŵa ni chindu chachi?” <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Che Sansoni ŵajanjile, “Andaŵaga ni ngonji syasambano syanganisitumiche ni mundu, pelepo ni pachime ni machili mpela mundu jwine jwalijose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Pelepo che Delila ŵajigele ngonji syasambano, ŵantaŵile nasyo. Nipele ŵanyanyisye achinsalilaga kuti, “Che Sansoni Ŵafilisiti akuikanga.” Ni aŵala ŵangondo ŵaŵaliji nkwajuŵilila che Sansoni, ŵaliji ku chuumba chine. Nombejo ŵakutwile ngonji syo mmakono mwakwe mpela akukutula usi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Che Delila ŵansalile che Sansoni, “Mpaka sambano nkuunambusya ni kuundenda jwakuloŵela. Muusalile muundu itajile pakuntaŵa.” Che Sansoni ŵanjanjile, “Mwandiŵaga mabutu saba ni kuundaŵilila kumo mu ntandio wa nguo ni kutaŵilila pa mikundasi, chiime ni machili mpela mundu jwine jwalijose.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Che Sansoni paŵagonile, che Delila ŵantiŵile mabutu saba ni kutaŵilila kumo mu ntandio wa nguo ni kutaŵilila pa mikundasi. Nipele ŵansalile “Che Sansoni ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti akunnyichilila.” Che Sansoni ŵajimwiche mu lugono, ŵaswekwile mikundasi jila ni kupapulanya ntandio wa nguo.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Che Delila ŵansalile che Sansoni, “Nkuti uli kuti nkuunonyela akuno nkulosya kuti ngankuusaka kwa kuunambusya? Muundesile jwakuloŵela katatu sano, nganimuusalila chachikuntendekasya nkole ni machili.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Che Delila ŵajendelechele kwakanganichisya che Sansoni kwa kwausyausya lyuŵa ni lyuŵa mwakuti paichile pakunsakalisya kwannope, mpaka nganakombola kupililila kwausyausya nkati chindu cho. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Mbesi jakwe che Sansoni ŵansalile che Delila yaili muntima mwakwe. Ŵansalile, “Umbo syangu nganisimyolekwe, pakuŵa uneji naŵichikwe pajika kwaligongo lya Akunnungu chitandilile ngunaŵe kupagwa. Namyolekwaga umbo syangu, pelepo machili gangu chigakopoche, tinjiŵa ni machili mpela mundu jwine jwalijose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Che Delila paŵaimanyilile kuti che Sansoni ŵaasalile yantemela yakwe yose, ŵaaŵilasile ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti, ŵaasalile, “Njisangane sooni pakuŵa asalile yantemela yakwe yose.” Ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵajawile kwa che Delila ali ajigele ipande ya madini ga feza iŵalanjile. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Che Delila ŵannyenjile che Sansoni kuti agone pa makongolo gakwe, ni ŵammilasile mundu ammyole mabutu gakwe saba gala. Nipele che Delila ŵatandite kunnagasya che Sansoni, ligongo machili gakwe galiji gankopweche. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Che Delila ŵanyanyisye achitiji, “Che Sansoni Ŵafilisiti akuikanga.” Che Sansoni ŵajimwiche mu lugono achiganisyaga kuti chakombole kulichenjela ni kulikulupusya mpela moŵa gose. Nganaimanyililaga kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji ŵaalesile. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Ŵafilisiti ŵala ŵankamwile che Sansoni ni kunkolopola meeso, ni ŵanjigele mpaka musi wa ku Gasa, ŵantaŵilile ni magwendegwede ga shaba ni ŵanjawisye mu nyuumba jakutaŵila ŵandu, ni kweleko ŵankanganichisye apanganye masengo ga kusyaga ngano. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Nambo umbo syakwe syatandite kumela ni kukula sooni.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Sansoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Ilongola ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵasongangene kuti atende chindimba ni kuntyochesya mbopesi nnungu jwao juŵaŵilanjikwe Dagoni. Nipele ŵajimbaga yeleyi, “Dagoni nnungu jwetu atukamwisye kunkamula che Sansoni jwammagongo jwetu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Ni ŵandu paŵaimanyilile iyaasime che Sansoni ŵanlapile nnungu jwao, ŵatite, “Sambano nnungu jwetu atukamwisye kwakamula che Sansoni jwammagongo jwetu juŵachijonasile chilambo chetu ni kwaulaga ŵandu ŵetu ŵajinji.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Ŵandu paŵasengwile kwannope, ŵatite, “Munnyichisye che Sansoni kuti atusangalasye.” Nipele ŵannyichisye che Sansoni kutyochela ku nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu, nombejo ŵang'andile paujo pao. Ŵammisile pasikati ja chanamila siŵili sisyakamulile nyuumba jo. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Che Sansoni ŵansalile nchanda juŵaliji nkunnongosya ali ankamwile nkono, “Muumiche pamalo pati tiingombole kamulila chanamila syasikukamulila nyuumba ji kuti nyegamile.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Nyuumba jo jagumbele achalume ni achakongwe ŵakwe, ni ilongola wose ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵaliji mwelemo, ni pegolofa pa nyuumba jo ŵapali achalume ni achakongwe chiŵandika ŵandu elufu tatu ali nkunlola che Sansoni ali nkwasangalalisya.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Che Sansoni ŵapopesile achitiji, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu choonde mungumbuchile une. Muundaje machili akano pe, kuti kwa chitendo chimo chi ngombole kwauchisye Ŵafilisiti kwa kuungolopola meso gangu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Che Sansoni ŵasikamwile chanamila siŵili sya mbindikati sisyakamulile nyuumba jose, nkono umo chanamila chimo ni nkono wine chanamila chaaŵili. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Che sansoni ŵatite, “Chimwe pamo ni Ŵafilisiti!” Ni ŵatutile chanamila sila kwa machili gakwe gose. Nyuumba jila jaagwilile ilongola wose ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji munkati mula. Kwayele pakatema ka chiwa chakwe, ŵaauleje ŵandu ŵajinji kupunda aŵala ŵaŵaauleje paŵaliji jwanjumi. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Achalongo achinjakwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵamunyuumba ja atatigwe ŵatulwiche kukujigala chiilu chakwe. Ŵajigele chiilu cho kumangwawo ni kwaula kukuchisika pasikati ja musi wa Sola ni musi wa Eshitaoli mu lilembe liŵansichile che Manoa atatigwe. Che Sansoni ŵaliji chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli kwa yaka ishilini.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Inyago i che Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Kwaliji ni mundu jumpepe juŵatamaga ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu liina lyakwe che Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Lyuŵa limo che Mika ŵansalile achikulugwe, “Ana nkukumbuchila aila ipande elufu moja na mia moja ya feza yanjiŵikwe? Uneji napali ni nampikene nli nkunlwesya mundu juŵanjiŵile. Nnole, ayapa, uneji ni junajiŵile.” Achikulwe ŵanjanjile, “Mwanangu, Ambuje Akunnungu ampe upile” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Che Mika ŵausisye ipande ya feza yo kwa achikulugwe, ni achikulugwe ŵatite, “Pakuti mwanangu nkalweseka, une nansyene nguityosya ipande ya feza yi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti tukolochesye chinyago chesepekwe ni kuchiunichila kwa madini ga feza. Sambano ngummuchisya mmwejo ipande ya feza yi.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Che Mika paŵammuchisye achikulugwe ipande ya feza ila, achikulugwe ŵasapwile ipande mia mbili ya feza, ŵampele jwachipala, nombejo ŵasepile chinyago, ni kuchiunichila kwa madini ga feza jo. Chinyago cho chaŵichikwe mu nyuumba ji che Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Che Mika ju, ŵakwete malo gakwe gakupopelela. Ŵakolosisye likoti lyakuunichila pantima lya jwakutaga mbopesi ni chinyago, ni ŵansagwile jumo mwa achiŵanagwe kuŵa jwambopesi jwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Pa gele moŵa go mwaliji mwangali mwenye mu Isilaeli, kila mundu ŵagambaga kutenda yailiyose muŵasachile.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Pa moŵa gagogo jwapali nchanda juŵatamaga ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda. Jwanchanda ju jwaliji Mlawi. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Nchanda ju ŵasamile ku Beselehemu ni kwaula kukusosa liuto liine lyakutama. Mu kwenda mo ŵaiche ku nyuumba ji che Mika ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Che Mika ŵammusisye, “Ana nkutyochela kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Uneji ndili Mlawi, ngutyochela ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda. Ngupita nchisosa malo gakuti ndame.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Che Mika ŵansalile, “Ntameje ni une, mmeje mshauli jwangu ni jwambopesi jwangu ni jwakuusalila chilichose chakusaka Akunnungu nachitende. Chinjimpa ipande likumi ya feza kila chaka ni nguo ni yakulya.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Nchanda Mlawi jula jwakundile kutama pamo ni che Mika. Jwatemi mu nyuumba ji che Mika mpela jumo jwa achiŵanagwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Che Mika ŵansagwile nchanda Mlawi jo kuti aŵe jwambopesi jwakwe, nombejo ŵatamaga kumangwakwe che Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Che Mika ŵatite, “Sambano ngumanyilila kuti Ambuje Akunnungu tachitenda indu yangu inyendele yambone, pakuŵa ngwete nchanda Mlawi ju mpela jwambopesi.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Che Mika ni lukosyo lwa Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Pa gele moŵa go mwaliji mwangali mwenye mu Isilaeli. Sooni pa moŵa go lukosyo lwa Dani lwaliji nkusosa malo gakuti gaŵe gao achinsyene gakutama pakuŵa kuichila pa katema ko ŵaliji ŵangapegwa malo gakuti gaŵe gao achinsyene pasikati ja ngosyo sya Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Kwayele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵaatumile ŵangondo ŵa machili nsano kutyochela ku Eshitaoli ni ku Sola kuwakilisha koo zote. Ŵaasalile ajaulangane kukuchilolesya chilambo chakuti akatamanje. Ŵandu wo ŵaiche ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu, ni ŵaiche kumangwakwe che Mika kuŵagonilenje chilo cho. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Ali chiŵela kumangwakwe che Mika, ŵammanyilile nchanda Mlawi jula maŵechete gakwe. Nipele ŵanjaulile ni kummusya, “Ana nkutenda ichichi akuno? Ŵani ŵannyichisye mmwejo akuno? Kwachichi nli apano?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Une nalangene ni che Mika jwaakundipa, kuti mbanganye masengo mpela jwambopesi jwakwe.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Ŵandu wo ŵansalile nchanda jo, “Choonde atuuchisye kwa Akunnungu iŵaga ulendo wetu wu chitupate chitukuchisaka?”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Jwambopesi jula ŵaasalile, “Nkakolanga lipamba, Ambuje Akunnungu akunnongosya pa ulendo wu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Pelepo ŵandu nsano ŵala ŵatyokangene, ŵaiche ku Laishi. Kweleko ŵaweni ŵandu ŵakutama mwelemo iŵatite kutama kwa chitendewele mpela muŵatamilaga Ŵasidoni. Ŵatemi mkutulala ni nganakola lipamba, ŵakwete kila chindu mu chilambo mwao. Ŵanyawo ŵatamaga mwakutalikangana ni Ŵasidoni, ni nganakamulangana ni mundu jwalijose. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Ŵandu nsano ŵala piŵausile ku Sola ni ku Eshitaoli, achalongo achinjao ŵausisye chiŵachiweni kweleko. <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Njimuchanje twende tukachigungumichile chilambo cho. Uwe twachiweni chilambo cho kusyene chikwete chajila. Uli chintamanje apano pangali chakutenda? Njanguyanje twende tukachijigale chilambo cho. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Patinkaiche kweleko chinkasimane ŵandu wo yakuti pakutama mchitendewele. Chilambo cho chili chachikulungwa ni chikwete kila chindu chitukuchisaka mu tame wetu, ni Akunnungu ampele mwanya.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Nipele ŵandu mia sita ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵatyosile ku Sola ni ku Eshitaoli ali ajigele yakumenyanilana yao, kwaula kukuputana ngondo. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Ŵandu wo ŵakwesile ni kwaula kukuŵika chigono chao kwele Kiliati Yealimu, ku chilambo cha Yuda. Lyelelyo ni ligongo, chakumaswelelo lyuŵa kwa Kiliati Yealimu pakuŵilanjikwa Mahane Dani mpaka lelo jino, malumbo gakwe “Chigono chi che Dani”. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Kutyochela pelepo, ŵapite ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu ni kwika kumangwakwe che Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Aŵala ŵandu nsano ŵaŵajawile kukuchilolesya chilambo cha Laishi ŵaasalile achalongo achinjawo, “Ana nkwimanyilila kuti akuno jimo mwa gele majumba ga, mwana likoti lyakuunichila pantima ni inyago ya minungu ni chinyago chesepekwe ni kuchiunichila ni madini ga feza? Nipele nganisyanje chakupanganya.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Nipele ŵakulolesya chilambo ŵala ŵajawile kumangwakwe che Mika, kuŵatamaga jwanchanda Mlawi, ni ŵankomasisye. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Pa katema ko, ŵangondo mia sita ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani, ŵaŵajigele yakumenyanilana ya ngondo ŵala ŵajimi pa nnango. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Aŵala ŵangondo nsano ŵaŵajawile kukuchilolesya chilambo, ŵajinjile nkati ŵachijigele achila chinyago chesepekwe ni kuchiunichila kwa feza, ni likoti lyakuunichila pantima ni inyago ine, akuno jwambopesi jula ali ajimi pannango pamo ni ŵandu mia sita ŵaŵajigele yakumenyanilana ŵala. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Jwambopesi jula paŵaaweni ajinjile mu nyuumba ji che Mika ni kwigala chinyago chesepekwe ni kuchiunichila ni feza ni likoti lyakuunichila pantima pamo ni inyago ine ila, ŵaausisye, “Ana nkutenda chichi?” <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Mmyalale, nkaŵecheta chilichose! Ntukuye kuti mme mpela mshauli jwetu, ni jwambopesi jwetu. Pambone ni papi, kuŵa jwambopesi kwaligongo lya nyuumba ja mundu jumo pane kuŵa jwambopesi kwaligongo lya lukosyo lose lwa Ŵaisilaeli?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Jwambopesi jula paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵasangalele kwannope, ŵalijigele likoti lyakuunichila pantima lila ni inyago ine ila ni chinyago chesepekwe ni kuunichila ni feza chila, ŵalongene ni ŵandu ŵala.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Nipele ŵagalawiche ni kuutanda ulendo, akuno ŵanache ni ilango yao ni yoombo yao ŵailongwesye. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Ali ajeesile kwakutalichila kutyochela ku nyuumba ji che Mika, che Mika ŵaaŵilasile ŵapachiŵandi pakwe ni kwaŵenda ŵaakamuchisye kuti aiusye indu yakwe. Nsyene jo pamo ni ŵandu wo waakuilisye ni kwaŵandichila ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Ŵaliji nkunyanyisyanga. Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵagalawiche ni kummusya che Mika, “Nkusaka ichichi mpaka nnyiche ni mpingo wa ŵandu wose wo?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Che Mika ŵajanjile, “Mwanya njigele minungu jangu jingolosisye, sooni munjigele jwambopesi jwangu. Sambano uneji sigalilwe ni ichichi? Ana nkuusya uli kuti ‘Nkusaka ichichi?’ ” <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵanjanjile, “Mmbaya ntame jii, nangaŵa yeleyo ŵane mwa uweji ŵaali ni lutumbilo akaika kungungumuchila, nomwe pamo ni ŵamunyuumba jenu timmwe.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵajendelechele ni ulendo. Che Mika paŵaiweni kuti ŵaapundile machili ŵagalawiche ni kuuja kumangwakwe.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵajigele aila indu iyakolosisye che Mika, ŵanjigele nombe ajula jwambopesi. Nipele ŵajawile ku musi wa Laishi, kuŵatamaga mchitendewele ni pangali lipamba. Ŵaauleje ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mwelemo kwa lipanga ni kuutinisya musi wo ni mooto. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mu musi wo nganapagwa mundu jwakwakulupusya ligongo musi wo watalikangene ni musi wa ku Sidoni ni sooni nganakamulangana ni ŵandu ŵane. Musi wo waliji pa lichemba lyalili chiŵandika ni ku Beti Lehobu. Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵautaŵile sooni musi wo ni kutama mwelemo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Ŵauŵilasile musi wo Dani liina lilyaliji lya che Dani nangolo jwawo, mwanache jwa Isilaeli. Kundanda ko musi wo waŵilanjikwe Laishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵaijimiche inyago ila kuti aipopelele, ni che Yonasani mwanagwe che Gelishomu chisukulu chi che Musa ŵaliji jwambopesi. Achiŵanagwe nombe ŵaliji ŵambopesi ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani mpaka ŵandu ŵa chilambo cho paŵajigalikwe ku ukapolo. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Katema kose Lisakasa lyakusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu pajaliji ku Shilo, ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Dani ŵaipopelaga yele inyago iŵaikolosisye che Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Mlawi ni chilanga chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Pa gele moŵa go mwaliji mwangali mwenye mu Isilaeli. Kwaliji ni Mlawi jumo juŵatamaga nti jwannendo kwakutalichila ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu. Mundu ju ŵakwete chilanga kutyochela ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Nambo chilanga jo ŵaundwiche. Mlawi jula ŵannesile mwali jo nombejo ŵausile kwa atatigwe, kwele ku Beselehemu ko musi wa Yuda, ŵatemi kwa miesi ncheche. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lyuŵa limo jwannume jo ŵapite kukunchondelela mwali jo, kuti aujile kukwakwe. Nipele, ŵanjigele jwamasengo jwakwe ni mbunda siŵili. Mwali jula ŵampeleche ku nyuumba ja atatigwe, nombe atatigwe mwali jula paŵammweni ŵampochele kwa magasa gaŵili. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Atatigwe mwali jula ŵanchondelele kuti akatyoka. Nipele ŵatemi ni atatigwe mwali jula kwa moŵa gatatu, achilyaga ni kung'wa ni kugona kukoko. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Pa lyuŵa lyancheche ŵalaŵilile kwimuka ni kuliŵika chile kuti ajaule. Nambo atatigwe mwali jo ŵatite, “Ntande kulya kaje mpateje machili, ni njauleje.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Nipele ŵele ŵandu ŵaŵili wo ŵatemi kulya ni kung'wa yalumo. Nipele atatigwe mwali jo ŵansalile mundu jula, “Choonde ngone apano chilo chi ni kusangalala.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Mundu jula paŵatiji kuti ajaule atatigwe mwali jula ŵanchondelele kwannope ni kunsalila atameje, nombejo chilo cho ŵagonile kukoko. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Kundaŵipe palyuŵa lyansano mundu jula ŵajimwiche achisakaga kwaula, nambo atatigwe mwali jo ŵansalile, “Choonde nlyeje kaje. Nlindilileje muusi ni njauleje.” Nipele ŵandu ŵaŵili wo ŵalile yalumo.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Mlawi jo pamo ni mwali jo ni jwamasengo, paŵajimwiche kuti ajaule, atatigwe jwankongwe jo ŵansalile, “Nnole lyuŵa lipite, sambano kuswele. Ngoneje papapa nsangalale. Malaŵi njimuche kundaŵipe, mmutande ulendo wa kumangwenu.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Nambo Mlawi jo ŵakanile kugona sooni pelepo chilo cho. Nipele ŵajimwiche ni kutanda ulendo, ni ŵaiche chiŵandi ni musi wa ku Yebusi, agano moŵa gano musi wo ukuŵilanjikwa Yelusalemu. Ŵaliji ni mwali jula ni jwamasengo jwakwe ni mbunda syakwe siŵili sila. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Paŵaŵandichile ku musi wa Yebusi chilo chaliji chiŵandichile, jwamasengo jula ŵansalile ambujegwe, “Ana ligongo chichi tukajinjila mmusi wa ku Yebusi ni kugona mwelemo?” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Ambujegwe ŵanjanjile, “Ngatugalauka ni kwinjila mmusi wachilendo, musi wati ŵandu ŵakwe ngaŵa Ŵaisilaeli. Tutujendelechele ni ulendo mpaka ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Twende tuchalile tuiche ku musi umo mwa misi jiŵili ji, tukagone ku Gibea pane ku Lama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Nipele ŵajendelechele ni ulendo, lyuŵa lyakapilaga ali aŵandichile ku Gibea, musi wauli mu chilambo cha lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Ŵajinjile mu musi wa ku Gibea kuti akagonanje mwelemo chilo cho. Ŵajawile kutama paluŵala lwa musi pakuŵa nganapagwa mundu jwalijose juŵaapochele kumangwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Ali chiŵela pelepo, jwannume jwanchekulu ŵapitile achityochelaga kumigunda kwakwe. Mundu ju kumangwakwe kwaliji ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu, nambo pamoŵa go ŵaliji nkutama ku Gibea nti jwannendo. Ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku Gibea ŵaliji ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Jwanchekulu ju paŵalolite ŵammweni jwapaulendo jo paluŵala lwa musi, ŵammusisye, “Ntyochele kwapi? Nomwe nkwaula kwapi?” <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Ŵanjanjile, “Uweji twaliji ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda, sambano tukwaula kumusi, ku chilambo cha ikwesya cha Efulaimu. Twaliji ku Beselehemu chilambo cha ku Yuda ni sambano ngwaula ku nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangu. Ngulilasika kuti ngapagwa mundu jwalijose pelepa jwatupochele kumangwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Nambo uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu tujigele yakulya ya mbunda syetu ni mikate ni divai kwa une ni mwali ju ni jwamasengo jwangu. Tukwete yosepe.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Jwanchekulu jula ŵansalile, “Ngumpochelanga kumangwangu, chinjimpa yose yaikunsoŵa. Nkagona apano paluŵala pa.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Nipele ŵaajigele ŵandu wo kumangwakwe ni kusilisya mbunda sila. Ŵaapele meesi achalendo wo, ni ŵanyawo ŵaligulwile makongolo gao, ŵalile ni kung'wa.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Paŵaliji nkusangalala, chisisimuchile ŵandu ŵangalumbana ŵakutyochela mu musi mo ŵajisyungwile nyuumba jo ni kutanda kuputa nnango. Ŵansalilaga jwele jwanchekulu nsyene nyuumba jo kuti, “Munkoposye jwannume jwaiche kumangwenu jo, tukusaka tugone nawo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Nambo jwanchekulu nsyene nyuumba jo ŵakopweche paasa, ni ŵaasalile, “Ngaŵa yeleyo achinjangu. Choonde nkatenda chindu chakusakala nnope mpela chelechi. Mundu ju ali jwannendo jwangu, nkampanganyichisya chindu chaasoni chi. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Mpilikane, ngwete mwali jwangu jwangaonegana ni jwannume, ni sooni apali jwankongwe jwa jwannendo jwangu. Tinaakoposye sambano jino, mwajigalanje ni kutenda nawo chachilichose chinkuchisaka, nambo mundu ju nkampanganyichisya chindu chaasoni chi.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Nambo ŵandu ŵala nganampilikanila kose. Kwayele Mlawi jula ŵankopwesye jwankongwe jwakwe jula paasa kwa ŵandu ŵala. Ni ŵanyawo ŵanjigele ni kungona kwamachili chilo chose. Kuninkucha ŵannesile ajaule. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Kuninkucha jwankongwe jwakwe jula ŵaiche ni kugwilila pannago wa nyuumba ja jwanchekulu jula, muŵaliji jwannume jwakwe jula. Jwankongwe jo ŵakomweche mpaka lyuŵa pilyakopweche.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Jwannume jula paŵajimwiche kundaŵi ni kuugula nnango kuti ajaule, ŵasimene jwankongwe jo ali agonile pannango wa nyuumba jo magasa gakwe gali mpela akusaka kuukwaya nnango. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Ŵansalile, “Njimuche, twende tujaule.” Nambo jwankongwe jwakwe jo nganajanga pakuŵa ŵaliji awile. Ni ŵannyakwile ni kummika pa mbunda jakwe, ni ŵatyosile kuuja kumangwakwe. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Paŵaiche kumangwakwe ŵajigele chipula, ŵajigele chiilu cha jwankongwe jwakwe ni kuchikatanyakatanya iŵalo kumi nambili. Nipele ŵaijawisye iŵalo yo, kila chiŵalo kwa kila lukosyo lwa Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Jwalijose juŵaiweni yelei ŵatite, “Ngondoo! Chindu chanti nyi nganichikopochele namose kuoneka chitandilile lyuŵa lila Ŵaisilaeli paŵatyosile ku Misili kwichila lelo jino. Tuchiganichisye, tusalilane yakuti kutenda.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuliŵika chile kuputana ngondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli wose kutandilila ku Dani mpaka ku Beli Sheba pamo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Gileadi, ŵatyosile ni ŵasongangene kwele ku Misipa, paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Ilongola ŵa ngosyo syosepe sya Ŵaisilaeli ŵaiche paujo pansongangano wa ŵandu ŵa Akunnungu, ŵanawose ŵaliji ŵangondo laki nne ŵaakwenda wapasi, ŵaŵajigele mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Nipele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵapilikene kuti Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo akwesile kwaula ku Misipa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:3">Nipele, Ŵaisilaeli ŵammusisye Mlawi jula, “Ntusalile, chelechi chakusakala chi chatendekwe kwantiuli?” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Ajula Mlawi, jwannume jwa jwankongwe juŵaulajikwe jula ŵaajanjile achitiji, “Uneji ni chilanga changu twaiche ku Gibea musi wauli wa lukosyo lwa Benjamini kuti tukagone chilo cho kweleko. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Achalume ŵa ku Gibea ŵaiche chilo, ŵajisyungwile nyuumba jinagonile jo achisakaga kuumulaga. Ŵangonile kwamachili chilanga jwangu jo mpaka ŵawile. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Une nachijigele chiilu chakwe, nachikatenye iŵaloiŵalo ni kuchijausya chiŵalo chimo ku kila lukosyo, mwa ngosyo kumi na mbili sya Ŵaisilaeli. Pakuŵa ŵele ŵandu wo atesile chindu chaasoni ni chakusakala pasikati ja Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Mwanya wosepe nli Ŵaisilaeli, nliusye chintende ichichi.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Ŵandu wose kwanakamo ŵajimi nikuti, “Ngapagwa namose jumo mwa uweji juchaujile kumangwakwe namose ku lisakasa lyakwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Yeleyi ni ichitwapanganyichisye ŵandu ŵa ku Gibea. Chitutende gudugudu itutujile pakwaagumuchila. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Ni uwe chitusagule ŵandu likumi mwa ŵandu mia moja kutyochela mu ngosyo syose sya Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵandu mia moja mwa ŵandu elufu moja ni ŵandu elufu moja mwa ŵandu elufu kumi. Ŵandu wo chapanganye masengo gakwaichisya chakulya ŵangondo ŵachaŵe ni masengo gakwaputa ŵandu ŵa ku Gibea, ŵaali chilambo cha Benjamini kwa chindu chaasoni ni changalumbana chatesile mu Isilaeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Kwayele ŵangondo wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaŵasongangene pamo ŵajilene kwagungumuchila ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Ngosyo syose sya Isilaeli ŵapeleche ŵantenga ku chilambo chose cha lukosyo lwa Benjamini akaasalile, “Ana nkukombola chinauli kuchitenda chindu chakusakala chanti nnyi? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Sambano mwakoposye ŵandu ŵakusakala ŵa mu Gibea wo twaulaje kuti tutyose chindu chakusakala chi mu Isilaeli,” Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini nganiŵaapilikanila Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Nambo ŵandu wose ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵatyosile mmisi jawo ni kusongangana ku Gibea kuti amenyane ni Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Pa lyuŵa lila ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵaasongangenye ŵangondo elufu ishilini na sita ŵaakukombola kuputana ngondo, kutyochela mmisi jao, ali ni yakumenyanilana. Iyoyo peyo ŵasagulikwe ŵangondo mia saba kutyochela mu ŵandu ŵakutama ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Pasikati ja ŵele ŵandu ŵaŵasagulikwe wo kwaliji ni ŵandu mia saba ŵaakuputana chakunchiji, jwalijose ŵakombwele kuponya liganga kwa lingutanguta kuluputa luumbo pangakuluya. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵane wo kwatyosya Ŵabenjamini ŵaasongangenye ŵangondo laki nne, ŵaakumanyilila kuputana ngondo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵaisilaeli akuputana ngondo ni lukosyo lwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵakwesile kwaula pamalo pakwapopelela Akunnungu ku Beseli ko, ni kweleko ŵammusisya Akunnungu kuti, “Ana lukosyo chi luchilulongolele kukuputana ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini?” Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajanjile “Lukosyo lwa Yuda.” <verse eid="JDG 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Malaŵi jakwe Ŵaisilaeli ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe, ni ŵajawile kukuŵika chigono chiŵandika ni musi wa ku Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵakopweche pachigono ni kwima kila mundu pamalo pakwe kuti akaputane ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵakopweche paasa pa musi wa Gibea ni kuputana ni Ŵaisilaeli, pa lyele lyuŵa lyo ŵauleje Ŵaisilaeli elufu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵakwesile sooni pa malo pakwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwalilila Ambuje Akunnungu mpaka ligulo. Ni ŵausisye Ambuje Akunnungu kuti, “Ana tujaule kaaŵili tukamenyane ni achalongo achinjetu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:22">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajanjile “Elo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵalimbisyene ntima achinsyenepe, ni ŵalipanjile sooni mmalo mwawo kuputana ngondo ni lukosyo lwa Benjamini, peuto palapala paŵalipanjile kuundanda. <verse eid="JDG 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Kwayele pa lyuŵa lyaaŵili Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵandichile kukuputana ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Pa lyuŵa lyaaŵili li, ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵatyosile ku Gibea ni kwagungumuchila Ŵaisilaeli, ni ŵaauleje ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli elufu kumi na nane. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Nipele ŵandu wose ŵa Chiisilaeli ŵakwesile kwaula pamalo pakwapopelela Akunnungu kwele ku Beseli. Ŵatemi kweleko paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ali nkwalilila Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵataŵile lyuŵa lila mpaka ligulo ni kwatyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi syakutinisya ni mbopesi sya chitendewele. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaŵendile Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaape ushauli pakuŵa kele katema ko Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyaliji kwele ku Beseli ko. <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Che Finiasi mwanache jwa che Eleasali chisukulu chi che Haloni ni juŵaliji jwambopesi juŵalilolelaga Lisanduku lyo. Ŵaisilaeli ŵaausisye Ambuje Akunnungu, “Ana tujaule sooni kuputana ni achalongo achinjetu ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajanjile, “Njaulanje. Malaŵi tinjinkamuchisya kuti mwapute.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Pelepo Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaŵisile ŵangondo mwakulisisa kusyungula musi wa ku Gibea kuti aujuŵilile. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵakwesile kukuputana ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini pa lyuŵa lyaatatu. Ŵalipanjile mmalo mwao chiŵandi ni musi ŵa ku Gibea mpela muŵatesile kuundanda. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Nombe ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵakopweche kukuputana ni Ŵaisilaeli, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵalambuchisye kutila kuti atalikangane ni musi. Mpela muŵatesile kuundanda Ŵabenjamini ŵatandite kwaulaga Ŵaisilaeli ŵane mwakulanguka ni mmatala gamakulu gagakwaula misi ja ku Beseli ni ku Gibea. Ŵaisilaeli ŵaŵaulajikwe ŵaliji salasini. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵaganisyaga kuti, “Twaputile mpela mutwatendele kuundanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:32">Nambo Ŵaisilaeli ŵasalilene kuti, “Uweji tuutuche kuti twanyenje atyoche mu musi, aichanje ku litala lyalikulu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Kwayele ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli ŵatyosile mmalo gao ni kulipanga sooni kwele ku Baali Tamali. Achinjawo ŵaŵaliji nkujuŵilila ŵatyosile mwakwanguya mmalo muŵalijuŵile mula chakumaswelelo lyuŵa mwa musi wa Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Nipele ŵangondo elufu kumi ŵaakukombola kuputana ngondo yambone ŵaŵaasagwile kutyochela mu ngosyo syosye sya ku Isilaeli ŵajawile kwaputa ŵandu ŵaakutama mmusi wa ku Gibea. Ngondo ja lyele lyuŵa lyo jalimbile kwannope. Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini nganaimanyililaga kuti konasikwa kwao kwaliji kuŵandichile. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatendekasisye Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapunde ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini. Ŵaisilaeli ŵaauleje ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini elufu ishilini na tano ni mia moja pa lyele lyuŵa lyo, wosepe ŵaliji ŵangondo ŵaŵakombolaga kutumia mapanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Kwayele Ŵabenjamini ŵaiweni kuti aputikwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JDG 20:36">Ŵaisilaeli iŵatite kwapunda Ŵabenjamini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Kwapele, Ŵaisilaeli ŵalitesile akuujila panyuma mpela akwatila Ŵabenjamini kuti ŵaaleche aŵala ŵaŵalijuŵile chiŵandi ni musi wa ku Gibea ŵaapute Ŵabenjamini. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Ŵakujuŵilila ŵala ŵatesile mwakwanguya kwinjila mu Gibea, ŵajenele ni kwaulaga ŵandu wose ŵa musi kwa lipanga. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaliji ajilene ni ŵakujuŵilila ŵala kuti chiŵaatendele chimanyisyo. Ŵajilene kuti pachaliwone lyosi mwinani kutyochela ku musi wo, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />nipele augungumuchilanje musi wo. Katema ko ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵaliji auleje Ŵaisilaeli salasini, kwayele ŵasalilene kuti “Kusyene twaputile mpela itwatite kuundanda.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Nambo lyosi lila palyatandite kwela mwinani kutyochela mmusi ula, Ŵabenjamini paŵagalawiche, ŵatojime kuuwona musi wao uli nkutinika mooto. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵaagalauchile, ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵajinjilwe ni lipamba, pakuŵa ŵaimanyilile kuti alinji mu chiwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Kwayele ŵagalawiche, ŵaautwiche Ŵaisilaeli kwaula mu ukweti, nambo ngondo jaakuyaga, ni ŵakamulikwe pambindikati ja mipingo jiŵili ja ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli. Ni ŵangondo ŵa Chiisilaeli ŵaŵatyosile mmusi ŵala, ŵaauleje Ŵabenjamini ŵala. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaasyungwile Ŵabenjamini mbande syose, ni ŵaatopwele kutyochela ku musi wa Noha mpaka kungopochelo lyuŵa mwa musi wa Gibea ni kwaulaga ŵandu ŵajinji. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Pa lyuŵa lyo ŵangondo elufu kumi na nane ŵakukombola kuputana ngondo yambone, mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵaulajikwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Ŵabenjamini ŵane ŵagalawiche ni kuutuchila muukweti mpaka kulwala la Limoni, Ŵaisilaeli ŵauleje ŵandu elufu tano ŵaŵautukaga. Ŵaisilaeli ŵajendelechele kwatopola mpaka ku Gidomu, ni kweleko ŵaauleje ŵangondo ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini elufu mbili. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Pa lyuŵa lila ŵauleje ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini elufu ishilini na tano, ŵaŵaliji ŵangondo ŵakukombola kuputana ngondo yambone. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Nambo ŵangondo mia sita ŵakombwele kuutuchila mu ukweti mpaka ku lwala la Limoni, ni ŵateminji kweleko kwa miesi ncheche. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵaaujilile sooni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ŵaauleje ŵanawose. Ŵauleje achalume ni achakongwe ni ŵanache ni ilango yao, ni misi jinajose jiŵajisimene kweleko ŵajichomile mooto.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Achakongwe ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Ŵaisilaeli paŵasongangene ku Misipa ŵatesile chilanga kwa Ambuje Akunnungu achitiji, “Ngapagwa namose jumo mwa uweji jutanlombekasye mwali jwakwe kwa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Nipele ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵajawile ku Beseli kukupopela, ŵateminji kweleko mpaka ligulo achinyanyisyaga ni kwalilila Akunnungu kwa ligogo. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Ŵatite, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa Ŵaisilaeli, kwachichi yeleyi itendeeche kukwetu? Ligongo chichi lukosyo lumo lusimasiche mu Isilaeli?” <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Malaŵi jakwe kundaŵipe ŵandu ŵajimwiche, ŵataŵile chilisa, ni pelepo ŵantyochesye Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi sya kutinisya ni mbopesi sya chitendewele. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Nipele ŵausyene, “Uli, mwa ngosyo syose sya Ŵaisilaeli lupali lukosyo lwalulilose lwangaika pa nsongangano uwatendekwe paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ku Misipa kula?” Pakuŵa ŵandu wo ŵalumbilile kuti, mundu jwalijose jutaŵe nganajaula paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ku Misipa ko, mundu jo aulajikwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Nambo Ŵaisilaeli ŵaakolele chanasa achalongo achinjawo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, ni ŵatite, “Lelo lukosyo lumo lwa Ŵaisilaeli lusimasiche. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Sambano tututende ichichi pakuti twape achakongwe, ŵele achalume ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵasigalile wo? Pakuŵapo twamasile kulumbila kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ngatwapa achiŵali ŵetu kuti aŵe achiŵankwawo!” <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Nipele ŵausyene sooni “Ana mpingo chi mu ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli wanganiuika pa nsongangano patwajawile kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu kwele ku Misipa ko.” Ŵaimanyilile kuti nganijupagwa mundu jwalijose juŵatyosile ku Yabeshi Gileadi juŵaiche ku nsongangano wo. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Pakuŵa pele paŵaaŵalangaga ŵandu nganapagwa namose mundu jumo kutyochela ku Yabeshi Gileadi. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Nipele nsongangano wa Ŵaisilaeli wo, ŵalamwile kwatuma ŵangondo elufu kumi na mbili ŵangajogopa ni kwasalila kuti, “Njaule nkaulaje kwa lipanga ŵandu ŵakutama ku Yabeshi Gileadi pamo ni achakongwe ni ŵanache. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Nkaaulaje achalume wosepe, ni kila jwankongwe jwawonegene ni jwannume.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Nambo kwele ku Yabeshi Gileadi ko, ŵaasimene achiŵali mia nne ŵaŵaliji ŵanganaonegane ni jwannume jwalijose, ni ŵaajigele ni kwajausya pa chigono kwele ku Shilo, pa chilambo cha ku Kanaani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Pelepo nsongangano wose ŵaatumile ŵantenga kwa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵaŵaliji ku lwala lwa Limoni kwasalila kuti ngondo jimasile. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Nipele ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵala ŵausile pa katema kakoko, ni Ŵaisilaeli ŵane ŵala ŵaapele ŵanyawo achiŵali ŵakutyochela ku Yabeshi Gileadi aŵala ŵanganaaulaga. Nambo achiŵali wo ŵapelembele.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Ŵaisilaeli ŵala ŵalilasiche kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatesile lukosyo lumo lusimasiche mu ngosyo sya ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Nipele achakulu ŵa nsongangano wose ŵausyene, “Kwangali achakongwe mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini. Ana tutende ichichi pakuti twape achakongwe ŵele achalume ŵasigalile wo? <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Ikusachilwa achalume ŵaasigalile ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini apegwe achakongwe kuti lukosyo lwao lujendelechele, kwayele lukosyo lwalulilose mu Isilaeli lukamala. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Nambo ngatukombola kwalombekasya achiŵali ŵetu, pakuŵa twamasile kulumbilila kuti mundu jwalijose jutanlombekasye mwali jwakwe kwa jwannume jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini alweseche.”<verse eid="JDG 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Nipele ŵakumbuchile kuti lyuŵa lyekulungwa lya Ambuje lyalikutendekwa kila chaka ku Shilo liŵandichile. Musi wa ku Shilo uli kumpoto kwa Beseli ni chakulujenda kwa Lebona, iyoyo peyo musi wu waliji chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa litala lyekulu lyalikutyochela ku Beseli kwaula ku Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Nipele ŵaalajisye aŵala achalume ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵanganapata achakongwe, achitiji, “Njaulanje nkalijuŵe mmigunda ja misabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />nkaalolechesye, achiŵali ŵa ku Shilo akopokaga paasa kukutyala pa katema ka chindimba, nkakopoche mmigunda mo ni kila mundu akankamule mwali jumpepe ni kunjigala kuti aŵe ŵankwakwe. Nipele mmujangane ku chilambo cha Benjamini. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Achatati ŵao pane achachimwene ŵao aikaga kutulalamichila chitwasalile kuti ‘Choonde tukummenda mwakolele chanasa ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ni kwalechelela ŵaajigale achiŵali wo, pakuŵa nganitukombola kwapa achakongwe ku ngondo ja ku Yabeshi Gileadi kula. Ni pakuŵa ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene nganimwatyosya achiŵali ŵenu wo kukwetu, nganinkola magambo gakukasa chilanga chilichose.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Achalume ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵala ŵatesile yeleyo, jwalijose ŵalisagulile mwali pasikati ja achiŵali ŵaŵakopweche paasa kutyala kwele ku Shilo ko ni kunjigala kuŵa ŵankwakwe. Nipele ŵausile ku chilambo chao chiŵapegwilwe, ŵataŵile sooni misinda jao ni kutama. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Katema kakoko Ŵaisilaeli ŵatyosile, kila mundu ŵausile pamalo pa lukosyo lwakwe ni pa ulongo wakwe. Kila mundu jwausile pa malo gapegwilwe paŵe pakwe.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Pa gele moŵa go mwaliji mwangali mwenye mu Isilaeli, kila mundu ŵagambaga kutenda yailiyose muŵasachile.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>